INSERT INTO `blogs` (`IdBlog`, `Blog`, `ImageBlog`, `DescriptionBlog`, `CategoryBlog`, `StatusBlog`, `updated_at`, `created_at`) VALUES
('10-unique-desk-decor-ideas-to-boost-creativity-at-work required', '10 Unique Desk Decor Ideas to Boost Creativity at Work required', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/sJMRNdsN_1744726424.jpg', '<p>Your desk isn’t just a place to work—it’s your personal creative zone. A well-decorated desk can elevate your mood, increase productivity, and even spark new ideas. Whether you’re working from home or in an office, these unique desk decor ideas will help you create a space that inspires.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Resin Art Desk Lamps</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Add a touch of magic to your desk with a custom resin art lamp. These handmade pieces often include flowers, galaxies, or anime-inspired designs, bringing personality and warmth to your workspace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/15459den.15169-300x300.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Personalized Keycaps for Mechanical Keyboards</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Customize your keyboard with artisan keycaps made of resin and wood. Not only do they feel great to type on, but they also turn your keyboard into a work of art.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. Mini Zen Garden</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bring tranquility to your day with a mini Zen garden. Raking patterns in the sand during a stressful moment is both meditative and visually pleasing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/103-300x300.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Nature-Inspired Resin Coasters</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Functional and beautiful, resin coasters with real dried flowers or wood slices can protect your desk while adding elegance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5. Motivational Quote Plaques</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Inspirational messages can help start your day right. Choose a handcrafted plaque with a quote that resonates with you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>6. Minimalist Plant Holders</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Succulents or air plants in resin or concrete planters are low-maintenance and instantly liven up your space.<br>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/K7A5371-300x300.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>7. Themed Figurines for Fans</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you’re into anime, Marvel, or video games, adding mini figurines lets you express your fandom subtly and stylishly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>8. Mood Lighting with LED Strips</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>LED strips under your monitor or desk can create a cozy or futuristic vibe, helping you work at night or set the mood for focus.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/dungvan-20-of-111-300x300.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>9. Desk Organizer with Character</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Use an organizer made from wood, resin, or recycled materials. It helps reduce clutter while contributing to the overall look.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>10. Aromatherapy Diffuser</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>A diffuser can keep your workspace smelling fresh and help reduce stress with essential oils like lavender or peppermint.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Revamping your desk with these thoughtful items isn’t just about looks—it’s about making your workday more enjoyable. Start small, choose the items that reflect your style, and turn your workspace into your happy place.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>👉 <em>Explore our handmade resin desk decor at </em><a href=\"https://galaxyresinart.com/\">Galaxy Resin Art</a><em> and bring creativity to your space today!</em></p>', 'resin-lamp-new-2026', 1, '2025-06-04', '2025-06-04'),
('18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps', '18 best places to buy artisan keycaps', NULL, '<p>Artisan keycaps are considered a neat way to personalize and fun up your mechanical keyboard. Pop on a few of these handmade keys to show off your favorite character, food item, or even something exhilarating just for laughs. There’s an artisan keycap for almost anything you can think of and it is no exaggeration to say that it brings the world to your fingertips.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the grounds that the keycaps market currently offers a ton of options in terms of shapes, designs, and motifs, you may be confused about <strong>where to buy the best artisan keycap</strong>, you are in the right article because we would like to recommend some websites with an excellent reputation and can be trusted as go-to places you can buy <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=artisan-keycaps\">artisan keycaps</a> of your dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Where_to_buy_Artisan_Keycaps\">Where to buy Artisan Keycaps</a></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#1_Amazon\">1. Amazon</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#2_Etsy\">2. Etsy</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#3_Heroverseart_-_A_rising_star_in_the_artisan_keycaps_market\">3. Heroverseart - A rising star in the artisan keycaps market</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#4_Drop_-_One_of_the_most_popular_places_to_buy_artisan_keycaps\">4. Drop - One of the most popular places to buy artisan keycaps</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#5_Mechanicalkeyboards\">5. Mechanicalkeyboards</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#6_Keycapsetscom\">6. Keycapsets.com</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#7_KPRepublic\">7. KPRepublic</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#8_AliExpress\">8. AliExpress</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#9_eBay\">9. eBay</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#10_rMechmarket\">10. r/Mechmarket</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#11_Dwarf_factory\">11. Dwarf factory </a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#12_Suitedupkeycaps\">12. Suitedupkeycaps </a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#13_Tinymakesthings\">13. Tinymakesthings </a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#14_Candykeys\">14. Candykeys</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#15_Kbdfans\">15. Kbdfans</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#16_Hot_Keys_Project\">16. Hot Keys Project </a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#17_Jellykey\">17. Jellykey </a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#18_Capsmiths\">18. Capsmiths </a></li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Factors_to_consider_when_buying_artisan_keycaps\">Factors to consider when buying artisan keycaps</a>\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Price\">Price</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Durability\">Durability</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Sound_and_comfort\">Sound and comfort</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Design\">Design</a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Keycap_Profile\">Keycap Profile </a></li>\r\n		<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#The_Buying_Process\">The Buying Process</a></li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#How_to_affix_an_artisan_keycap\">How to affix an artisan keycap</a></li>\r\n	<li><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/18-best-places-to-buy-artisan-keycaps#Summary\">Summary</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Where to buy Artisan Keycaps</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Amazon</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Amazon is one of the biggest marketplaces in the whole world and can be accessed from every corner of the earth. This platform provides a variety of products that humans need, mechanical keyboard components are no exceptions. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although Amazon may have the least inspired collection, this is one of the most trusted websites that you can use to find artisan keycaps. You are still able to find a variety of artisan keycaps products with cool designs and very affordable prices on Amazon. And we’re pretty sure that their catalog will continue to grow along with the development of the custom mechanical keyboards market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"hzHcGnRf_1742849409.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/hzHcGnRf_1742849409.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Etsy</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Etsy is another trusted website that provides most artisan keycaps products with price variants. On this website, you can find artisan keycaps with a wealth of unique and cool designs on the grounds that thousands of artisan keycaps manufacturers sell their products on Etsy. But it’s crucial to look at the ratings or reviews first to make sure you purchase artisan keycaps from shops that have a good reputation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"ucue1SgQ_1742849410.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/ucue1SgQ_1742849410.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. </strong><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/\">Heroverseart</a><strong> - A rising star in the artisan keycaps market</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Heroverseart offers a massive number of artisan resin keycap collections so that you can pick up your favorites to spice up your mechanical keyboard. We keep you in the picture on not only artisan keycaps but also other product lines from resin and wood namely <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=wrist-rests\"><strong>wrist rests</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\"><strong>epoxy lamps</strong></a>. They are all made with tremendous resources, expertise, and artistry. If you are wondering where to buy artisan keycaps of your dream, Heroverseart is the go-to place to start browsing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"5mxAqZYn_1742849410.jpg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/5mxAqZYn_1742849410.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Drop - One of the most popular places to buy artisan keycaps</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://drop.com/home\">Drop</a> caters to mechanical keyboard and audiophiles aficionados. The website is divided into two main sections: One for all things related to mechanical keyboards, and the other for audio equipment, such as amps and headphones. Hence, you can also browse for a wealth of artisan keycaps with multifarious designs made of various materials such as transparent plastic, glass, and many other artisan keycap materials.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While Drop’s catalog of artisan keycaps is not as extensive as websites like Etsy, the design and quality of the keycaps are highly impressive. If you want premium quality artisan keycaps, Drop is the site you should head to.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"hWjd6Yor_1742849412.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/hWjd6Yor_1742849412.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5. </strong><a href=\"https://mechanicalkeyboards.com/shop/\"><strong>Mechanicalkeyboards</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Avid keyboard enthusiasts may already be familiar with Mechanical Keyboards as this online shop is known for its wide range of keyboard-related products. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>When it comes to artisan keycaps, Mechanicalkeyboards also offers various artisan keycaps products from various well-known brands so that you can choose according to your taste. The price of artisan keycaps on Mechanicalkeyboards is also fairly affordable and the quality is very accountable. If you are in search of something cute at a low cost or something unique without a firm budget, MK is a beginner-friendly place you can think of. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"RXWGYpHY_1742849413.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/RXWGYpHY_1742849413.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>6. </strong><a href=\"https://keycapsets.com/\"><strong>Keycapsets.com</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keycapsets.com is another trusted website to buy quality keycaps sets. You can also do a group buy through Keycapsets.com. You will also get fully updated about group purchases, such as when new group purchases will start or end, group purchases that are still ongoing, and those that have ended. This is so far one of the best places to buy artisan keycaps you desire.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"iBxJ09vh_1742849415.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/iBxJ09vh_1742849415.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>7. </strong><a href=\"https://kprepublic.com/collections/keycaps\"><strong>KPRepublic</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kprepublic is a website that sells various kinds of mechanical keyboard components. This is one of the favorite websites for mechanical keyboard custom enthusiasts to find the mechanical keyboard components of their dreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kprepublic offers many artisan keycaps products with super stunning and unique designs at a reasonable price. Moreover, the quality of the artisan keycaps available here is quite impressive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"ls1PSEkF_1742849417.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/ls1PSEkF_1742849417.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>8. </strong><a href=\"https://www.aliexpress.com/\"><strong>AliExpress</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>AliExpress is one of the largest marketplaces in Asia and is one of the largest marketplaces in the world nowadays. AliExpress provides various artisan keycaps from thousands of stores on their platform. Being based in China also contributes to the pricing of products being noticeably lower. You can easily find an assortment of good quality and cool artisan keycaps at a fairly affordable price through this online marketplace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"dqkw2RIX_1742849417.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/dqkw2RIX_1742849417.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>9. </strong><a href=\"https://www.ebay.com/\"><strong>eBay</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>eBay is probably the most popular “formal” marketplace which offers buyer protections on our list. You can find both brand-new and second-hand artisan keycaps from vendors here. You’ll come across everything from unique gag jokes to scarce gems from a previous group buy. This is one of the websites we highly recommend if you want to purchase artisan keycaps. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Qu94yj66_1742849419.jpg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/Qu94yj66_1742849419.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>10. </strong><strong>r/Mechmarket</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Another answer to the ultimate question of where to buy artisan keycap r/Mechmarket. r/MechMarket is Reddit’s lively marketplace for everything related to mechanical keyboards. In this forum, users can freely sell and search for artisan keycaps products. Here you are also able to find very rare limited edition artisan keycaps. Unfortunately, the price of artisan keycaps on this forum is very unstable according to your bidder.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Ww4Am7mx_1742849420.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/Ww4Am7mx_1742849420.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>11. </strong><strong>Dwarf factory </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Dwarf Factory has been put on the map for perfecting the art of creating artisan keycaps. Each of their collection comes with its own lore, inspired by a multitude of world-building elements like fantasy tales, mythical creatures, popular video games, or even a tiny hamburger shop. It is no exaggeration to say that each keycap is a portal to a miniature world. One of the most outstanding products, also their best-seller, is their keycap line named Petite Meal Collection. So don’t hesitate to pay it a visit in case you are wondering <strong>where to buy artisan keycaps</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"TP8GijnF_1742849421.jpg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/TP8GijnF_1742849421.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>12. </strong><a href=\"https://suitedupkeycaps.com/\"><strong>Suitedupkeycaps</strong></a><strong> </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Suitedupkeycaps is a trusted online store where you can browse for thousands of artisan keycaps. This is a personal website created specifically to sell their artisan keycaps. The artisan keycaps products at Suitedupkeycaps are distinct because the design of the artisan keycaps they make is not as common as the artisan keycaps on the market. Suitedupkeycaps is the perfect place to go if you want to find the most unique artisan keycaps you’ve ever seen before.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"hrzm1oGb_1742849423.jpg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/hrzm1oGb_1742849423.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>13. </strong><a href=\"https://www.tinymakesthings.com/\"><strong>Tinymakesthings</strong></a><strong> </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tinymakesthings is originally a personal blog but it has now turned into a sales website that specifically sells artisan keycaps. The interesting thing is, that you can make an order of the artisan keycaps you want via email, as long as they are able to make them, they will definitely turn your desired keycaps into reality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"IVWQVho7_1742849424.jpg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/IVWQVho7_1742849424.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>14. </strong><a href=\"https://candykeys.com/\"><strong>Candykeys</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Candykeys is another website that has an excellent reputation among custom keycaps enthusiasts. Candykeys is known as a website that provides limited-edition mechanical keyboards and keycaps and they only provide pre-order purchases for rare products like GMK keycaps for example. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Candykeys also offers a wide selection of artisan keycaps with unique and gorgeous designs and guaranteed quality. For artisan keycaps, quite a lot are in-stock and ready to ship without having to make a pre-order.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Ap3KnbD7_1742849426.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/Ap3KnbD7_1742849426.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>15. </strong><a href=\"https://kbdfans.com/\"><strong>Kbdfans</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kbdfans is a trusted website that is very popular among mechanical custom keyboard enthusiasts. This well-known manufacturer provides various products of mechanical keyboard components such as switches, casings, keycaps, stabilizers, PCBs, and others. At Kbdfans, you can also pick up artisan keycaps with excellent quality and unique designs at very affordable prices. their products such as Tofu65 and KBD67 are 2 custom keyboards that are very in demand in the market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"XwKXoW5R_1742849427.jpg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/XwKXoW5R_1742849427.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>16. </strong><a href=\"https://www.shopline.com/\"><strong>Hot Keys Project</strong></a><strong> </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Another artisan keycaps brand loved by the keycaps aficionados is the Hot Keys Project. This brand is well-known for incorporating pop culture and cartoon characters into its designs. You should not miss out on the brand if you are a pop culture lover. On the grounds that Hot Keys Project also offers membership to their community, you can easily avail of discounts depending on your grade. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"XgqUk01R_1742849427.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/XgqUk01R_1742849427.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>17. </strong><a href=\"https://www.jellykey.com/\"><strong>Jellykey </strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Second to the last to be featured in this article is the brand named Jellykey. Jellykey is well known for its original and creative designs, which are not only focused on pop culture or world-building elements like other brands. The point which sets this brand apart from the others is that it gets inspiration from abstract artwork and other obscure references. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"uNTbGPTA_1742849429.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/uNTbGPTA_1742849429.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>18. </strong><a href=\"https://capsmiths.com/\"><strong>Capsmiths</strong></a><strong> </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The very last answer to the question of where to buy artisan keycaps is Capsmiths. This is a trusted website among the keycaps community that you can pay a visit to pick up the artisan keycaps of your dream. Capsmiths provides a wealth of artisan keycaps with unique and cool designs. The quality of the artisan keycaps provided at Capsmiths is also quite high quality. The minus point is that there are not as many artisan keycaps on this website like others.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"9nIqtavo_1742849430.jpeg\" src=\"https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/summernote/9nIqtavo_1742849430.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Factors to consider when buying artisan keycaps</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Besides the ultimate question of where to buy artisan keycaps, there are still numerous other factors you have to take into account before making up your mind to purchase your favored artisan keycap. Let’s scroll down to find out!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Price</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Artisan keycaps can range widely in price. Anywhere from $10-100 and sometimes more. There are at least three reasons contributing to the fact that artisan keycaps are so exorbitant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of them is that they are in short supply despite increasingly high demand. Almost every keyboard enthusiasts and gamers yearn for this kind of decoration and therefore looks forward to possessing their own set of artisan keycaps to their liking. Such high demand results in an inevitable increase in its price, given that there are only certain manufacturers of artisan keycaps on the market. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Another reason for its steep price is the amount of time and effort that goes into crafting and designing each item on the grounds that Artisan keycaps usually are handcrafted and hand-painted by the artist. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Last but not least, consider that artisan keycaps are extremely rare and highly sought after. There are many people out there who have no hesitance to pay a high price tag for a truly distinct design that few can get their hands on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The combination of all of these reasons culminates in the steep price of artisan keycaps.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Durability</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Custom keycaps are relatively durable, but several factors will determine the actual lifespan of any keycap. The material used to make the keycaps and the manufacturing process will have a significant impact on durability. In addition, the total number of keystrokes and the amount of wear and tear will determine how long keycaps last.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Resin is a material that has been long proven to withstand the test of time. As this is the case, it is guaranteed to say that artisan keycaps can stand heavy and long-term usage subject to inevitable wear and tear. This is also why artisan keycaps are usually put on modifiers unlike alphanumeric keycaps as these are not widely used. However, take into account that decorated or highly detailed artisan keycaps degrade quickly because of their nature. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sound and comfort</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before purchasing a keycap, take a look at typing tests and think about your preferences. The sound and feel of a keycap are determined by its shape. Cylindrical, shorter keycaps provide a louder and lower-pitched typing sound than spherical, taller keycaps. SA keycaps can have a steep learning curve.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As a rule of thumb, you should avoid thin, laser-engraved keycaps. These types of keycaps can be great for showing off the coloring lit but are often made from low-quality <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/abs-vs-pbt-keycap-which-is-better/\">ABS material</a> and uncomfortable to type on. Hence, the keycap should be thick. Thick-walled keycaps often give a sense of being more solid under the finger and are ideal when typing (up to about 1.5mm).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Design</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>There is a wide range of design concepts you can choose from. On the current keycaps market, you may come across artisan keycaps with designs for almost anything you can think of namely widely popular anime series, pop culture references, animals, astronomy, etc. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Keycap Profile </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the most important factors to consider when buying artisan keycaps is the <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/guide-to-different-keycap-profiles/\">keycap profile</a>. Keycap profile refers to the overall size and shape of the keycap on a given row of a keyboard. This keyboard element help to enhance the ergonomics and the aesthetics of mechanical keyboards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are two main types of keycaps profiles: uniform profile and sculpted profile. Some keycap profiles namely the Cherry profile offer better experiences for gaming setup while some are more suitable for typing and other applications, particularly OEM profile, so you have to make up your mind which profile is best suited for your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The Buying Process</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the keyboard world, there are typically two ways to buy something: group buys and raffle. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want a product immediately, you can purchase a raffle design that is available and ready to ship. This is the most common type of sale among all and is generally the most affordable option.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But in case you want a product that goes through exclusive runs and the manufacturer only makes a limited amount, group buys are your best option.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Group buys are a way to buy a future custom-made product that hasn’t been made yet. You’ll typically have to make a payment in advance and wait a few months for the manufacturers to complete the product. If you want to opt for a group buy, take into account that it usually takes a long period before your order arrives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buying artisan keycaps through group buys or raffles is ultimately up to how soon you want the product, how customized it needs to be, and how much you’re willing to shell out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to affix an artisan keycap</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>After buying artisan keycaps, you need to know how to affix them to your keyboards. To do this, no matter the variation in shape or size, you’ll need a keycap puller. Otherwise, the process is pretty simple to carry out and oddly satisfying. </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Unplug your keyboard. Or switch the keyboard off in case you have a wireless keyboard.</li>\r\n	<li>Remove the original key from your keyboard by using the keycap puller. The switch which is right under the keycap and connected to the board will now appear. A cross-shaped stem also protrudes as well. </li>\r\n	<li>Align the cross-shaped indent at the bottom of the keycap with the stem on your keyboard.</li>\r\n	<li>Gently press down with equal pressure to secure the keycap. </li>\r\n	<li>Tap the key a few times to make sure that it is firmly attached to the keyboard.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Summary</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aesthetics is the cherry on top of building your mechanical keyboard. It may deprive you of money and effort, but the satisfaction you get in expressing your personality through your custom keyboard is, to some extent, priceless. Point in case, your satisfaction and happiness are ultimately questioned as to whether the product you bought is worth purchasing or not. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hopefully, through this in-depth article, you have given your own answer to the question of <strong>where to buy artisan keycaps.</strong> </p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-10-30', '2025-10-30'),
('dark-pokemon-keycap-button-collection-from-galaxy-resin-art', 'DARK POKEMON KEYCAP BUTTON COLLECTION FROM GALAXY RESIN ART', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/xJRaJr56_1744725169.jpg', '<p>The latest dark collection comes from Galaxy Resin Art during Tet 2025.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We’re very proud to release this collection, a Pokemon themed handmade keycap, as we worked on designing them with a dark backdrop. Whether you are a “Pokemon” fan or not, you will love it!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How can one put an elephant inside the refrigerator? At Galaxy Resin Art, such a question was changed to a more challenging version: How do I put Pokemon in a 1-unit manual keycap? We have been working on this since the very beginning, i.e. 1 year ago. And now, after a long time crafting keycaps and immersing ourselves in Pokemon movies, we proudly present to you a collection of Pokemon with a dark setting!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>With the first set, Galaxy Resin Art brings keycaps that are familiar pokemon from the famous cartoon Pokemon. They are Gengar, Mewtwo, Eternatus, Darkrai, Giratina, Zekrom. All in a mysterious dark setting. Each design carries the characteristics of the pokemon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Like many other handcrafted keycaps from Galaxy Resin Art, the collection is designed with powerful details in mind. But unlike other handmade keycaps, the collection was first conceived in 2021 and developed over a year, undergoing a lot of changes and updates.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>It goes like this:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The original design featured bright, natural settings, in standard keycap form. We had the ambition to portray the truest generation of pokemon, which is still the main idea behind the collection. We’ve watched Pokemon so many times just to study the shape, form (and for our entertainment purposes too).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/10-6.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dark pokemon keycap button collection from Galaxy Resin Art</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have to admit that no keycap design took us longer than this collection. The reason is that our workmanship and production technology are somewhat limited. On the other hand, previous designs have not satisfied us in terms of ideas, details, and fine art.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>As die-hard Pokemon fans who’ve stayed up all night watching Pokemon, we believe keycaps must present the same horrors, and barbarism as they appear in the movies. However, the lovely side, the cute element in the eyes of Pokemon lovers must also show. We’re proud to say we’ve finally achieved both with our current collection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>In addition to the design, the color of the collection takes a long time to stand out. For now, we’ve settled on a color scheme for each design. However, the collection remains hard to chew through to the very end. Since the design is very detailed, including many sharp edges (such as details of eyes, claws, shapes, etc.), it requires a steady hand to draw and shade objects on the microscale. . class, and patience does not stop when the craftsman slips.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is more special is that the artists who draw them are disabled people, they only have passion and enthusiasm for keycaps. That is what makes many great products as you are seeing. It is an arduous process, but they have proven what Galaxy Resin Art wants to convey “We are physically defective but not mentally and mentally defective”.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Don’t miss the first Group Buy from Galaxy Resin Art in months. Don’t miss this collection!</p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-06-04', '2025-06-04'),
('handmade-resin-artisan-125-u-keycap-for-mechanical-keyboard', 'HANDMADE RESIN ARTISAN 1.25 U KEYCAP FOR MECHANICAL KEYBOARD', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/PmOKQWzB_1742803842.jpg', '<p>Finally, you can now have custom 1.25u keycaps that are affordable, unique, and maintenance-free at hand! </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Why get our artisan keycaps?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have been designing keyboards from the ground up to last a lifetime with mechanical keys that are tested for durability. We also have a patent-pending design for a backlit keyboard where you can see what you type in any light!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Black and red koi keycap\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hirosarts.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/red-keycap-1.jpg?resize=328%2C460&amp;ssl=1\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Black and red koi keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>▪ One-of-a-kind <a href=\"https://hirosarts.com/\">artisan keycaps</a> for your mechanical keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>▪ This 1.25 keycap is perfect for any custom keyboard. Unlike most other handmade keycaps that are fragile and expensive, our affordable spacebar is handmade of rugged, durable material. It has a protective coating to prevent wear and tear. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Notes </p>\r\n\r\n<p>▪ These 1.25 u keycap are handmade in Vietnam by skilled craftsmen, so each is different</p>\r\n\r\n<p>▪ Keeps your keyboard safe from overheating</p>\r\n\r\n<p>▪ Use a soft toothbrush or a cotton swab to clean the keycap without worrying about discoloring the buttons\' characters</p>\r\n\r\n<p>▪ These keycaps come in a variety of colors and styles, and we can make them in any style you want. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>▪ Please note, keycaps only, no keyboard included</p>\r\n\r\n<p>     Install custom 1.25 u keycap today</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Custom 1.25 u keycaps are a great way to customize your keyboard’s aesthetics and make your typing or gaming experience more comfortable and efficient. You deserve a great keyboard that is designed for resilience and built to last. See what we have to offer and invest in your future today so you can type confidently knowing that your keyboard has got your back!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Heroverse is a family-owned artisan shop that sells the world\'s best custom keycaps. Visit our site to explore a wide range of 1.25u artisan keycap at</p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-05-27', '2025-05-27'),
('the-soul-of-artisans', 'The soul of artisans', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/0HsjnHB5_1744726574.jpg', '<p>Playing keycaps  is becoming a more and more popular hobby among young people. In this article, Galaxy Resin Art will provide you with detailed information about the keycaps production process .</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/1.-Artisan-Keycaps-Spirit-of-Artisans-2-1536x864.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Artisan Keycaps - Spirit of Artisans</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Artisan keycaps </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Artisan keycaps are designed caps that are markedly different from regular keycaps and allow users to add a personal touch to their keyboard. They can be made from a variety of materials, but resin and clay are more common.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>An art key can be created into a cartoon character, or a flower and even a forest with mountains, rivers, trees, … or any shape under the talented hands of the artists.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Artisan keycaps are completely handmade products, so the production process is complicated and requires high meticulousness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Production process</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The production process at Galaxy Resin Art is extremely strict from sketching ideas to packing goods. Our team of 20 artisans are all handicapped from Vietnam, physically handicapped but not mentally handicapped. We always try our best to bring the best products to our customers with our burning passion and desire. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each necessary stage is performed by skilled artisans with a minimum of 3 to 5 years of experience. </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 1: Outline the product idea</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sketching the idea is the first step of the production process and also the most difficult step. The artist begins to put the ideas in his head on the paper with strokes, according to the horizontal and vertical proportions of the keycaps. Finalize and correct redundant details if any.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For custom-designed keycaps, the artist gives the customer drawings for evaluation and suggestions for adjustment and the artist corrects them as required. This process usually takes about 2-3 days.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/2.-Phac-thao-y-tuong-1.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Concept Sketch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 2: Create a 3D template or design to create the first prototype. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>After sketching on paper, the artist begins to design a multi-dimensional model with software, turning ideas on paper into 3D models. The purpose of 3D design is to help the product image be sketched in the most detailed and accurate way and to make it easier for artists to review prototypes and refine if any.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 3: Basic shape of the 3D printed keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After completing the processing, adjusting the position, size and orientation of the model, the system will start to build the printed product by building layer by layer. material. The process is conducted almost automatically, with little human intervention.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/3.-Keycap-duoc-in-bang-cong-nghe-3D-2.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 4: 3D printed models are washed with a special solution</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keycaps need to be treated after 3D printing with a separate solution to ensure a smooth and glossy surface.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 5: Illuminate the model with UV lamp</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Use of 3D lamps to cure the epoxy gloss coating, increasing the hardness of the product.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 6: Paint the base paint for the keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When overlaid with other colors, the base paint helps the keycap to be more standard, more beautiful and closest to the prototype</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 7: Paint multiple layers of colors, from a large array of colors to the details. Small color detail 0.1mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is the most difficult stage, requiring absolute concentration and meticulousness. The beauty of the keycap depends largely on this process. Artists will begin to paint keycaps with their own style, highlighting the artist’s own personality through the small keycaps.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Colors are gradually painted from the bottom of the keycap, from a large array of colors to a small color. Everything is done with care and precision. Because these are handmade keycaps, each keycaps has its own character, especially in color.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/vlcsnap-2022-06-11-16h26m41s308-2.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Multi-layer paint keycap colors</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 8: Pour turpentine</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In both molds: large and small. Both have 2 small round holes in the middle. After the artist has prepared the resin mixture, they will pour the mixture into the hole of the small mold. Next, they put the keycaps over the resin layer to glue the parts together. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/4.-do-nhua-thong-2.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 9: The keycap mold is compressed in a high-pressure cage to eliminate air bubbles, creating absolute clarity</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The keycaps maker pours resin into the hole of the large mold and embeds the small mold with decorative details on the surface into the hole and lets it dry. To avoid creating bubbles that damage the keycaps, the artisan must compress them tightly so that air does not enter. After lifting the small mold from the hole, a wonderful resin keycap is finished.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 10: Cut out the excess details</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To create a complete keycap, the artisan cuts off the excess details with a grinding device. The removal of redundant details makes the keycap more accurate and</p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-06-04', '2025-06-04'),
('the-whole-collection-of-pokemon-keycaps-instead-of-sending-love-to-that-person-on-valentines-day', 'The whole collection of Pokemon keycaps instead of sending love to that person on Valentine’s Day', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/dqIJCNF4_1744726187.jpg', '<p>Valentine’s Day is a special day to honor the couple’s love and also an opportunity for couples to express their love to each other. Let Galaxy Resin Art and you send your loved ones meaningful gifts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Blog56-1-1024x726.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pokemon artisan keycaps</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The duo of artisan keycaps for him on Valentine’s Day</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Diving into the story of Valentine’s Day, Galaxy Resin Art appeared with 2 Pokemon with colors representing pure and passionate love. This is also a gift to express your feelings to your other half meaningfully.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/kienpokemon10602-1-scaled.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/kienpokemon9976-1-scaled.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pokemon Breloom – A meaningful gift on Valentine’s Day</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With pink covering the keycap, this cute Breloom pokemon is like a gift instead of a confession to the one you love. Galaxy Resin Art is very honored and lucky to help you express your love to that person.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Chua-co-ten-1536-%C3%97-427-px-1536-%C3%97-542-px.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Eevee – Cute Pokemon, a meaningful Valentine’s gift for that person.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Galaxy Resin Art crates cute Eevee. Eevee has a band of smooth, cream-colored fur around their neck and a bushy, brown fox – like tail with a cream-colored tip. Eevee cuteness will be a surprise and romantic gift for the other half on Valentine’s Day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Chua-co-ten-1536-%C3%97-427-px-1536-%C3%97-542-px-1.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cubone – A romantic gift for your lover on Valentine’s Day</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cubone – a proud product of Galaxy Resin Art, every detail is meticulously and carefully made by us in every step. We bring the most perfect Cubones for that person on a meaningful Valentine’s Day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Chua-co-ten-1536-%C3%97-427-px-1536-%C3%97-542-px-2.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Galaxy Resin Art\'s wishes on Valentine\'s Day</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Galaxy Resin Art has evolved in many ways, from giving customers more choices in shopping. It all comes from opportunities that are none other than the best partners, the best friends we could ask for. We are so grateful to have you by our side.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>On Valentine’s Day, we thank you for being such a great partner. It is thanks to your trust and support that we have been able to realize our business goals and dreams. We send our best wishes of love and happiness to you on Valentine’s Day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Happy Valentine’s Day 2025!</p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-06-04', '2025-06-04'),
('top-3-things-about-mechanical-keyboard-case', 'Top 3 things about Mechanical Keyboard Case', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/54BISLpC_1744724921.jpg', '<p>1. What is a keyboard case?</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Keyboard case</strong> (keyboard cover) is the surrounding part to protect the mechanical keyboard. Because it is the largest part, the case plays an important role in creating the aesthetic of the keyboard. The effects of the case are not only protecting the keyboard, affecting durability but also affecting the typing feeling of the mechanical keys during use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/7-1.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keyboard Case</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2, Keyboard Case Classification</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On current market, cases are classified in two ways: size and material</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>By size: The most popular keyboard sizes include: Full-size (100%), TKL (80%), 75%, 65%, 60% and 40%, depending on the size of the keyboard to choose the most suitable and suitable case.</li>\r\n	<li>By material: This is a common classification of cases. The material determines the typing feel and the certainty of the keyboard. The most common case materials are aluminum and plastic, in addition, less common are acrylic cases and woodart cases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/6-2.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Woodart keyboard case</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3, Material of the case keyboard</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the market, keyboard cases are made from different materials. The two most common types are aluminum and plastic. Aluminum and plastic are the two materials that are easiest to mass produce, which is why there are so many keyboards in these two materials. Less common types of keyboard covers are acrylic and wood. Since acrylic and wood take a long time to make, if you want a case from these two materials, you should order in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PLASTIC CASE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Plastic is the most common material for making cases with the advantage of being the cheapest and easiest to manufacture of all materials. Most Plastic keyboard covers are usually black or gray, but other colors are also available.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/5-4.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Plastic case</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although it is the most common material for making keyboard covers, plastic is not the best material. Plastic case gives a bad experience when typingThere is a rattle, in addition, the feeling of wobbling when typing makes the keyboard feel unstable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This disadvantage can be improved by adding a shock absorber or metal plate to the inside of your keyboard. But in general, plastic is not the preferred material when making the case. However, because it is the most economical type of material, it will continue to be manufactured to keep costs low, so that many people do not have too much money to buy for their keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ALUMINUM CASE</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aluminum cases are another popular choice on mechanical keyboards. Aluminum case is heavier and more sturdy. This is a great option for those who want a sturdy and stable case. Aluminum case gives a good typing feeling, good typing sound. But the downside of the aluminum case is that it is less flexible, stiffer and heavie</p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-06-04', '2025-06-04');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`IdBlog`, `Blog`, `ImageBlog`, `DescriptionBlog`, `CategoryBlog`, `StatusBlog`, `updated_at`, `created_at`) VALUES
('top-3-things-to-know-when-choosing-keycap-size', 'Top 3 things to know when choosing keycap size', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/AgQJktG5_1744725465.jpg', '<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/shop4.11749-1024x768.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Playing keycaps is becoming a new and popular hobby among young people. However, to start participating in this subject, we need to equip ourselves with certain knowledge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>In this article, Galaxy Resin Art will provide you with basic information about keycap sizes and the top 3 things you need to know when choosing keycap sizes for your keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Lua-chon-kich-co-keycap-cho-ban-phim.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Select the keycap size for the keyboard</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Keyboard size unit: The Unit (u)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When searching for keycaps on e-commerce platforms, have you ever seen the parameters 1u, 2u,…? That is information about keycap size.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keycap size is usually measured in units (abbreviated as “u”). A normal standard alpha key is 1u in size, and the 2u key will be twice as long as the 1u key. However, are there many other keycaps of odd sizes like 1.25u, 1.5u, 1.75u, or even 6.25u? So how to know which position keycap has what size?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Define the layout and size of the keyboard</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Not only a keycap, but your keyboard also has many types of layouts and sizes: </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Layout: ISO/ANSI and JIS are the most common keyboard layout types. </li>\r\n	<li>Size: there are many different keyboard sizes, especially for custom keyboards, but the most popular keyboard sizes are Full Size/75%/65% and 60%, and 40% (supermini).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Thiet-ke-chua-co-ten-1.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fancy custom keyboard</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In this article, we will focus only on the standard ANSI 104 keyboard layout and size.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Standard keycap size</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The image below shows the keycap size on a standard ANSI 104 full-size keyboard:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Kich-co-keycap-tren-ban-phim-ANSI-104.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here is a more detailed summary of keycap sizes on ANSI 104 keyboards:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n	\r\n		\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Current</p><p>\r\n			\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Number of keys &amp; size</p><p>\r\n			\r\n		\r\n		\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 (Fn function key and number key)</p><p>\r\n			\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1u × 36</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>2u × 1</p><p>\r\n			\r\n		\r\n		\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2 (Tab, top line of alpha keys)</p><p>\r\n			\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1u × 18</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>1.5u × 2</p><p>\r\n			\r\n		\r\n		\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3 (Caps lock, middle alpha key line)</p><p>\r\n			\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1u × 11</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>1u with dash × 2</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>1u with dot × 1</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>1.75u × 1</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>2.25u × 1</p><p>\r\n			\r\n		\r\n		\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4 (Shift, line of alpha keys below use, line of Space )</p><p>\r\n			\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1u × 18</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>1.25u × 7</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>2u × 1</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>2.25u × 1</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>2.75u × 1</p>\r\n\r\n			<p>6.25u × 1</p><p>\r\n			\r\n		\r\n		\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other</p><p>\r\n			\r\n			\r\n			</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2u × 2 Numpad Plus và Numpad Enter</p><p>\r\n			\r\n		\r\n	\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking at the image above we can see, most of the letter keys, number keys, and some function keys have the smallest size of 1u, the spacebar has the largest size of 6.25u.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Conclusion</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In fact, besides choosing the right keycap size for the keyboard size, we also have to choose the right keycap for the keycap profile type, switch, and a lot of other information. Hopefully through this article, Galaxy Resin Art can make it easier for you to choose the keycap for your keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want to refer to some keycap samples according to the standard keyboard size, you can refer here. These cute and cool keycaps are waiting</p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-06-04', '2025-06-04'),
('top-5-switch-cherry-mx-you-cant-miss', 'Top 5 Switch Cherry MX you can’t miss', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/nGRkncXF_1744725585.jpg', '<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Thiet-ke-chua-co-ten.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. What is Cherry MX?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Switches are switches located under each key press, helping to send the key press signal and when releasing the key, the switch will return the key to its original position.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cherry Switch is the name of a Switch manufactured in 1953 and then gradually became the king in the Switch village, preferred by many keyboard manufacturers because of its durability as well as a variety of types to choose from.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Therefore, the cherry switch is favored and used by many famous keyboard manufacturers such as Fuhlen, and Filco.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/6-1.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Switch Cherry MX</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Cherry MX switches are used on mechanical keyboards. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.1. Cherry MX Green</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a type of cherry switch with a click, with a notch, which is considered the best-feeling switch for typists.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When in use, we will notice that there is a notch in the middle of the keystroke, so when pressing the key, it will create a very nice sound with only 50g force, very convenient when users type quickly and type a lot.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cons: Making noise for people around and having to clean often</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/2.-Switch-Cherry-MX-Blue.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Switch Cherry MX Blue</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.2. Cherry MX Brown</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For this cherry Switch line, they do not make a “click” sound like the Blue but instead, make a rather small “cough” sound. The turning force of the Switch Cherry Brown is 45g and is not dusty like Blue, which is very suitable for those who do not like noise and can bring the product anywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>In addition, there is also a Silent switch type, which is usually fitted with additional dampers to reduce the intensity of the sound emitted after each key press. This switch series is very suitable for those who need a quiet environment to work and play games.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/2.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Switch Cherry MX Brown</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.3. Cherry MX Red</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cherry Red Switch is one of the clickless, no-click cherry switches, the lightest of all switches. With a pressing force of 45g, it is suitable for games that need fast speed. </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Red Switch is also the quietest switch of all Cherry switches because of its extremely light feel, no tactile buttons, and no clicky sound.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The highlight of Switch Cherry Red is that the longer you use it, the smoother it will be, even if you use it for 5 or 10 years, you will always have the same experience as when you just bought it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/5.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cherry MX Red</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.4. Cherry MX Black</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The MX Black series is a non-click linear switch. This series uses a heavier spring than the MX Red (actuation force 60 gf) which provides more feedback and faster key bounce. The more tensioned spring makes the switch more responsive, making it easier to double-tap.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The downside of MX Black is that it requires more force to type, which is easy to cause fatigue when used for a long time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://breakwooden.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/1-1.png\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cherry MX Black</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.5. Cherry MX Silent (Black, Red, Speed)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  The keyboard sound is the sound you will hear every time you type on your keyboard to work or play games. Most in an office work environment or playing games that need concentration, if nothing special, often many people will prefer a quieter mechanical keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The silent switches are therefore very suitable for playing games in homes with many people or working in quiet offices or you simply don’t want to work on your PC but disturb others or attract unnecessary attention. This is also a way for users themselves to better focus on the game or work.</p>', 'key-cap-new-2026', 1, '2025-06-04', '2025-06-04'),
('what-are-gmk-keycaps-and-why-are-they-so-expensive', 'What are GMK keycaps and why are they so expensive', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/e125iJB4_1742803820.jpg', '<p><strong>Long waiting time to get the keycaps</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want to buy GMK keycaps, there is a high chance you will have to deal with the annoying long waiting time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The production process at GMK is considerably different since we have to join a group to be notified when fresh stocks are available. Generally, you have to wait until every GMK keycap set achieves or surpasses the minimum order quantity (MOQ). At that time, production can’t even start.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Therefore, regardless of how quickly you take advantage of <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/blog/what-are-keyboard-group-buys/\">the group purchase</a>, you will always have to<strong> wait for weeks or even months</strong> to acquire your favorite set of keycaps.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After all, this is the biggest concern you will get in the intensely competitive market for mechanical keyboards. There is no other way to get the greatest keycaps on the market but to be patient.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Limited availability</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You may be aware that limited edition things always go with <strong>limited quantities</strong>, which means that they are typically hard to find.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That’s true when purchasing a GMK keycap set.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can find all the keycap variations by searching on Google for \"GMK Keycaps Set\". Yet, you <strong>can\'t find the keycap styles and colors you like</strong>. In reality, you can’t order a GMK set with only one click. You must purchase them as part of a group buy or with interest checks since each new keycap set is released in a limited quantity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To get the information GMK keycaps you desire, you should actively participate in the community or group.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After scouring the group or forums, you will probably discover your dream GMK keycaps. However, if you come late, you will be the loser in this game, especially when limited edition GMK keycaps are released.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Incompatibility with non-standard layouts</p>\r\n\r\n<p>GMK keycaps are primarily designed for Cherry MX-style switches, which are the most common switch type. However, this means they may not be compatible with non-standard layouts or switches, limiting their versatility.</p>', 'resin-lamp-nightlight', 0, '2026-01-02', '2026-01-02');
