('going-merry-one-piece-ship-keyboard-knob', 'Going Merry One Piece Ship Keyboard Knob', 'New Arrival', 34.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/ZghMmvVz_Going-Merry-One-Piece-Ship-Keyboard-Knob-2.jpg', 'Artisan resin keycap, Personalized keycap, Anime Resin Keycap, Custom keycap set, Mechanical keyboards, Handmade keycap, Gift for boyfriends, ESC keycap, One piece keycap, Thousand Sunny Knob', '<p>Elevate Your Mechanical Keyboard with Going Merry One Piece Ship Keyboard Knob</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Going Merry One Piece Ship Keyboard Knob is a handcrafted product, upgrading your mechanical keyboard with the unique. Most importantly, this Knob is made from high-quality resin and built to last, standing up to regular use without losing its visual appeal. Its ergonomic design promotes smooth keypresses, helping to boost both productivity and gaming performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Moreover, this Going Merry One Piece Ship Keyboard Knob is expertly crafted with detailed precision, bringing a personal touch of One Piece to your setup while ensuring a comfortable typing experience. The vibrant colors and detailed design make it an eye-catching addition for any enthusiast.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Going merry one piece ship keyboard knob\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hirosarts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Going-Merry-One-Piece-Ship-Keyboard-Knob-4.jpg?resize=500%2C500&amp;ssl=1\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Going merry one piece ship keyboard knob</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Explore more of <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=keyboard-knobs\">Heroverse’s resin keyboard knobs</a> to bring a bit of anime magic to your keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support (Weak)</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 thank you card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade.</li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keyboard-knobs', NULL, '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('gojo-satoru-epoxy-night-light', 'Gojo Satoru Epoxy Night Light', 'Flash Deal', 59, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/D8nhlf9l_Gojo-satoru-night-light-7.jpg', 'Masterpiece Diorama, Epoxy Resin Night, Wood Lamp Light Dad, handmade Table Lamp, Home Decor Gift Mom, Gifts For Friend him, mother her Boyfriend, birthday anniversary, kid anime game movie, custom manga father, Gojo Satoru, Jujutsu Kaisen', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Size L: 2.8\"x4.7\"x2.8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt;</p>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('gold-koi-artisan-keycap', 'Gold Koi Artisan Keycap', 'New Arrival', 17.99, 39.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/GWFr3DyF_gold-koi-keycap-10.jpg.jpg', 'Koi fish keycap, keycap, handmade, resin, gift, Custom keycap, Keycap Artisan, koi, green koi, red koi, Gold keycap, keycap anime', '<p><strong>Breathe a new life into your keyboard with resin gold Koi keycaps </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Japanese culture, the Koi fishes are considered a symbol of good fortune, success, prosperity, and ambition. With the aim of incorporating those meanings into our products, the Koi keycaps collection in which <strong>gold Koi artisan keycaps</strong> are the signature product was born.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These <strong>handmade resin gold Koi keycaps</strong> are made of clear resin and feature miniature worlds inside: two Koi fishes swimming in their gold landscape.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each fish took approximately six days to complete. The tiny size and intricate design of molds make it very challenging for us to paint the Koi fishes and keep them vibrant and polished as much as possible. 3 – to 5 layers of paint are applied to each keycap so that it will be covered with a flimsy clear resin layer and a certain thickness of color. Transparency and meticulously coloring put on these SA profile artisan keycaps a subtle and dynamic look.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our <strong>gold Koi artisan keycaps</strong> products are perfect choices in case you want to breathe a new life into your mechanical keyboard or are looking for a gift idea for your friends and your family.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin epoxy</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Profile keycap: SA</li>\r\n	<li>Profile row: ESC</li>\r\n	<li>Height: 16 mm</li>\r\n	<li>Color: Gold keycap</li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support (weak)</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 koi keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may differ slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it into the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'cute-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('goten-and-piccolo-from-dragon-ball-epoxy-lamp', 'Goten And Piccolo From Dragon Ball Epoxy Lamp', 'Best Product', 59, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/ACuiUkjm_Goten-and-piccolo-from-dragon-ball-epoxy-lamp-7.jpg', 'anime lamp, epoxy lamp, nightstand lamp, table lamp, Demon Piccolo, dragon ball light, gaming setup, desk lamp, anime gift, goku, Christmas gift, custom night light, standing lamp', '<p><strong>Unleash the Magic: Goten and Piccolo from Dragon Ball Epoxy Lamp</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let us illuminate this iconic scene. Goten’s playful spirit and Piccolo\'s stern gaze, all captured in fluid resin. The details glow, creating a miniature world before your eyes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The light within is powered by a spectrum of LED brilliance. You command the color, you craft the mood of the space, with easy remote control; creating moments of comfort with every setting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The build is just as captivating. This piece is crafted with strong, clear resin - it will never yellow. It also has a warm wooden base. This combination is so timeless and feels right at home wherever you place it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It serves as a perfect desk lamp during the day, transforming into a soothing night light by night. Giving this as a gift will be a special way to show someone you care; it is also a meaningful way to treat yourself to a beautiful piece of art. We invite you to look at our full range of <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamps</a> on our site!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>M: 11cmx12cm (4.3\'\'x4.7\'\')</li>\r\n	<li>L: 14cmx16cm (5.5\'\'x6.3\'\')</li>\r\n	<li>XL: 17cmx19cm (6.7\'\'x7.5\'\')</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('green-river-resin-wood-ashtray', 'Green River Resin Wood Ashtray', 'New Arrival', 75, 97.5, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/3pXJlKdx_green-river-resin-wood-ashtray-5.jpg', 'vintage decor home, gifts for men, housewarming gift, birthday gift wood, anniversary gift, officiant gift him, groomsmen gift box, home decor wood, ashtray orange epoxy, ashtray green resin, ashtray resin, cigar gift box, vintage ashtray', '<p>Elevate your smoking experience with this exquisite handmade cigar ashtray. Crafted from premium wood and infused with vibrant epoxy resin, this unique piece offers both style and functionality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is a natural product. Just as in nature, every tree is different and every slab is different. There are many variations of walnut, wood grain and coloring will be different on each and every ashtray.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size S: 28x14.5x2.4cm</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 19x14.5x2.4cm</li>\r\n	<li>0.5 inches in error</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-trays', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('halloween-night-light', 'Halloween Night Light', 'Flash Deal', 69.99, 79.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/BNlD8kwv_halloween-night-light-2-1.jpg', 'Halloween Gifts,Michael Myers Figure,Halloween 1978,Resurrection 2002,Halloween H20 1998,Halloween 1995,Gift For Kids,Handmade lamp,Halloween Day&#039;s,Christmas gifts,Black Friday Sales,The Witch Model,Halloween Light', '<p><strong>Mesmerizing Halloween Night Light: Illuminate Your Fright Night!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ever wanted to capture the classic charm of All Hallows\' Eve, where shadows meet mystery, and keep them forever? That\'s where our <strong>Halloween Night Light</strong> steps in.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Inspired by the bewitching aura of the spookiest night of the year, our <strong>Halloween Night Light</strong> is more than just a source of illumination—it\'s a storytelling piece. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Halloween Night Light</strong> depicts a purple, hexagonal-shaped lamp with a silhouette of a witch flying on a broomstick over a haunted house in front of a full moon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each design element is steeped in the magic of old legends, with blue melting into a purple glow that brings to life the dance of witches, the whispers of phantoms, and the fleeting flutter of bat wings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Getting the Halloween jitters? Just turn this lamp on when it gets dark, and it\'ll be like you\'ve opened a doorway straight into a fantasy world anytime you want!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking for more magical night lamps? Explore our collection of <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">Epoxy Resin Lamps</a> that are perfect for the eerie charm lover.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Led: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 6.3\"x5.1\"x1.4\"</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb </li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand (USB plug with on and off button)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'halloween-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('hammerhead-shark-and-diver-night-light', 'Hammerhead Shark And Diver Night Light', 'Flash Deal', 59, 79.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/LOYHu2qY_hammer-shark-lamp-4.jpg.jpg', 'table lamp, Resin lamp, custom night light, wood lamp, diorama resin, modern table lamp, cool lamp, nightstand lamp, wooden lamp, baby shark, epoxy lamp, home decor, christmas gifts', '<p>Hammerhead shark and diver Night Light: Start your journey as a night hunter</p>\r\n\r\n<p>May you know that many swimmers and sailors get hammerhead shark tattoos as a talisman or lucky charm? It is said that the hammerhead shark will protect you from other harmful sharks and creatures under the sea.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Even as the best hunter in the ocean, the Hammerhead shark becomes extremely peaceful through this <strong>Hammerhead shark and diver Night Light</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The diver and Hammerhead shark in the cave are both well-lit by top-level light. When you turn on the lights during the night, your space will be filled with this peaceful and comfortable color.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Simply turn on the Hammerhead shark and diver resin lamp, lay your back on the bed and imagine the vast undersea world!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The night doesn\'t seem so scary when there\'s a brave predator by your side.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Be sure to check out more <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamps</a> at Heroverse. We’ll always give you the best surprises ever!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Led: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 12cmx8cm (4.7\"x3.15\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 20cmx 13cm (7.8\"x5.12\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 25cm x 18cm (10\"x7\")</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand (USB plug with on and off button)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('hello-kitty-keycap', 'Hello Kitty Keycap', 'Top Product', 29.5, 36.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/dRBNbUPx_Hello-kitty-artisan-keycap-5.jpg', 'keycaps, keycap set, custom keycap, wristwrest, custom keycaps, Etsy Keycaps, mechanical keyboard, Keyboard, custom coffee board, meow keycaps, meow cafe keycaps, hello kitty keycaps, hello kitty keybaord', '<p>Hello Kitty keycap will always listen to you!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We don’t know if most of you have heard of the story of how Hello Kitty was born. In short, a little girl needs a listening friend to share her sorrow and happy time. The lonely girl had had no one for that until Hello Kitty appeared.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Heroverse artisans do not know if it’s the story that makes us love this character a lot. Well, we just feel the urge to introduce the <strong>Hello Kitty resin keycap</strong> for those who grew up with this lovely cat like us.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Hello Kitty keycap is super adorable with her signature red bow. She will sit there silently and look closely at you. Whenever you feel a little bit down after a long day, we hope you can take comfort in knowing that she’s always there.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apart from the Hello Kitty artisan keycap, you can find other cute characters that have accompanied you through your childhood in our collection at this link.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don’t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n	<li>We can make the keycaps in your chosen colors so please inform us.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'cute-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('hogwarts-houses-harry-potter-night-light', 'Hogwarts Houses Harry Potter Night Light', 'New Arrival', 59, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/WveXb26R_Hogwarts-houses-harry-potter-night-light-8.jpg', 'Harry Potter, wizard decor, magic gift, wooden nightlight, Hogwarts fan, bookshop light, LED house, wizarding decor, music box, wish box, Flourish Blotts, magical gift, fantasy decor', '<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt;</p>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('hogwarts-houses-resin-keycap', 'Hogwarts Houses Resin Keycap', 'New Arrival', 30, 42.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/I62NL1V0_Hogwarts-Houses-resin-keycap-1.jpg', 'Handmade keycaps,custom keycaps,cute keycaps,ESC keycaps,keycap sets,Sorting keycaps,Resin keycaps,Shift keycaps,Bronze keycaps,Wasd keycaps,XDA keycaps,Harry Potter keycaps,keycaps', '<p>What Hogwarts Houses, Harry Potter keycaps do you want to hear?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the most exciting moments among the 7 books is the house announcing scene when you will know which <strong>Hogwarts Houses, Harry Potter keycaps</strong> the character will go in.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Gryffindor is a place for those with a chivalry spirit while in Hufflepuff, you will find people valuing hard work and fairness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Slytherin is where ambitious and resourceful people go to. And, only intelligent and creative people can step foot in Ravenclaw.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, who are you? Where will be your destined Hogwart House? Put on the Sorting Hat and see which<strong> Hogwarts Houses, Harry Potter keycaps</strong> will shout out your name. The one-of-a-kind euphoria moment. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>We hope the <strong>Hogwarts House keycap </strong>brings you a small joy of being able to dream this sweet Wizard dream. Care to tell us what your first choice Hogwart House is?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are into beautiful keycaps, don’t miss out on our collections.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Profile: SA profile</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-15', '2025-12-15'),
('hollow-knight-resin-keyboard-knobs', 'Hollow Knight Resin Keyboard Knobs', 'Top Product', 34.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/DHaprfAR_Hollow-knight-resin-keyboard-knobs-3.jpg', 'resin keycap, cute keycap, hollow knight pin, artisan keycap, custom keycap, keycap artisan, hollow knight, escape keycap, Gaming keycap, colorful knob, keyboard knob, shift knob, knob keycap gmk', '<p>Enhance Your Setup with Hollow Knight Resin Keyboard Knobs</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Elevate your keyboard aesthetics with our exquisite <strong>Hollow Knight Resin Keyboard Knobs</strong>. Each piece is meticulously handcrafted, ensuring a unique touch to your setup. These resin keyboard knobs not only provide a stylish upgrade but also offer enhanced tactile feedback for a superior typing experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handmade with precision, these knobs are designed to fit most mechanical keyboards. The detailed craftsmanship reflects the iconic Hollow Knight theme, making them a perfect addition for fans and collectors alike. By choosing these resin keyboard knobs, you add a personal and artistic flair to your workspace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ready to transform your keyboard? Explore our full range of resin keyboard knobs <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=artisan-keycaps\">here</a> and find the perfect match for your style.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech Specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Knob Types D</li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 knobs by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it into the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keyboard-knobs', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('hornet-sentinel-hollow-knight-resin-lamp', 'Hornet Sentinel Hollow Knight Resin Lamp', 'Flash Deal', 68.5, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/GQmkt6SY_Hornet-sentinel-hollow-knight-resin-lamp-5.jpg', 'handmade decor, resin art, unique gift, epoxy resin lamp, handmade lamp, fantasy lamp, custom resin lamp, led resin lamp, christmas gift, valentine gift, hollow knight, Knight Hornet, Hollow Knight gift', '<p><strong>Illuminate Your Space with the Handmade Hornet Sentinel Hollow Knight Resin Lamp</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Transform your room with the <strong>Hornet Sentinel Hollow Knight Resin Lamp</strong>, a handmade masterpiece that brings the iconic character to life. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this resin lamp captures the essence of Hornet Sentinel, making it a perfect addition for fans of the Hollow Knight universe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This lamp isn’t just about aesthetics—it provides a soft, ambient glow that enhances any space, creating a serene atmosphere for relaxation or focus. The <strong>Hornet Sentinel Hollow Knight Resin Lamp</strong> is ideal for both collectors and those seeking a unique decorative piece that doubles as functional art.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Explore more stunning creations like the <strong>Hornet Sentinel Hollow Knight Resin Lamp</strong> on our website and discover the perfect piece for your space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">Discover more epoxy lamps here</a> and elevate your home’s ambiance with our handcrafted designs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 5.5\"x2.8\"x2.8\" (13.97 cm x 7.11 cm x 7.11 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 6.3\"x3.5\"x3.5\" (16.0 cm x 8.9 cm x 8.9 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 6.7\"x4.7\"x4.7\" (17.0 cm x 11.9 cm x 11.9 cm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'halloween-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('humpback-whale-and-diver-night-light-ver-2', 'Humpback Whale And Diver Night Light Ver 2', 'Flash Deal', 59.99, 79.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/BPNsg8Yd_Humpback-Whale-and-Diver-Night-Light-ver-2-6-1.jpg', 'Gifts for her, Custom Night Light, Diorama, Resin Lamp, Blue night light, deep ocean decor, scuba diving gift, animal night light, Friendship Day, handmade lamp, gift for him, diorama ocean, blue deep', '<p><strong>Humpback Whale and Diver night light ver 2: Peace, Compassion, And Love</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every time the humpback whale comes to you, that\'s the time when you are under a lot of stress. You can be experiencing something tiring in your body or soul, or you might be lost your way.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Once the time comes when you need to breathe, call on our Humpback Whale and Diver night light ver 2.<br>\r\nTogether with the magical light of the ocean, the slow movement, and the echoing sound of humpback whales, all will help you inhale in the refreshing air.<br>\r\nOur Humpback Whale and Diver epoxy lamp ver 2 is so amazing, right? With Humpback Whale and Diver resin lamp ver 2, you will feel peace, compassion, and love all around and in your own soul.<br>\r\nDon\'t worry if you encounter something that makes you unhappy in your life, <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">Heroverse epoxy lamps</a> are always here to soothe your soul.<br>\r\n<strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Led: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 2.7x 5.9\" (7x15cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 3.5x9.5\" (9x24cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 4.5x11.5\" (11.5x29cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand (USB plug with on and off buttons)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('jellyfish-and-diver-night-light', 'Jellyfish And Diver Night Light', 'Flash Deal', 55.99, 65.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/q516aPkq_jelly-fish-epoxy-lamp-2.jpg.jpg', 'jellyfish lamp resin, custom resin lamp, gift for himt, Handmade gift, Baby gift, anniversary gift, home decor resin, housewarming gift, birthday gift, lamp epoxy resin, Table lamp, Art diorama lamp, Night light diver', '<p>Jellyfish and diver Night Light - The resin wood lamp that satisfied your aquatic love</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The ocean-themed <strong>resin wood lamp</strong> gives out a soothing blue glow with a mysterious undertone. Both the jellyfishes and the scuba diver are designed and painted with love, patience, and expertise.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After that, an acrylic mold is built around the wood. Blue resin is poured in to complete the aquatic scene, and small jellyfishes and diver figures are suspended in position. The resin is polished to a beautiful gloss and the edges are elegantly beveled once it has hardened. The scene is then placed on an illuminating foundation, which illuminates it from underneath, giving the <strong>Jellyfish and diver Night Light</strong> an ethereal aquatic feel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>By creating the fishes and diver as dynamic as possible, our artisans ensure the lamp\'s active and passive components are balanced. As a result, we devote endless hours and effort to bringing each and every detail to life. The lamp also comes with a remote control that allows it to produce <strong>different lighting colors</strong> to match your mood.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Notably, it comes in a unique triangular shape, separating itself from our ocean-inspired <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">resin lamp series</a>. The shape lends the piece a great surface to host all of the details we want and speak volumes to the majesty of the sea. Moreover, the piece can be a great decor ornament as well as a perfect ice-breaker for introverts!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 9.5cm x 9.5cm (3.8\"x3.8\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 18cmx 18cm (7\"x7\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 20cmx20cm (8\"x8\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('jellyfish-volume-switch-knobs-keycap', 'Jellyfish Volume Switch Knobs Keycap', 'New Arrival', 59.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/Frw2DMax_Jellyfish-Volume-Switc-Knobs-keycap-6.jpg', 'resin keycap gift, resin keycap, aquatic keycap, jellyfish keycap, Cute Keycap Set, Artisan Keycap, Keyboard Caps, Xmas Gift Idea, Girl Birthday Gift, Marine Life Keycap, Aesthetic Keycap, Cute Jellyfish, Cute Marine Animal', '<p>Elevate your keyboard aesthetics with the mesmerizing <strong>Jellyfish Volume Switch Knobs Keycap</strong>. Designed to captivate, these keycaps showcase intricate jellyfish motifs, adding a touch of aquatic elegance to your setup. The translucent design allows for customizable backlighting effects, creating a stunning visual display as you type. Upgrade your typing experience with these unique and functional Jellyfish Volume Switch Knobs Keycaps, bringing a touch of the ocean to your fingertips.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech Specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u</li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keyboard-knobs', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20');
INSERT INTO `products` (`IdProduct`, `NameProduct`, `TypeProduct`, `NewPrice`, `OldPrice`, `StatusProduct`, `ImageURL`, `Tag`, `Description`, `Category`, `SubCategory`, `updated_at`, `created_at`) VALUES
('kirby-artisan-keycap', 'Kirby Artisan Keycap', 'Flash Deal', 29, 39.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/nooZ2pi6_kirby-keycap-ver3-25.jpg.jpg', 'kirby keycaps, custom pokemon, pokemon gift, keycap cute, Keycap pokemon, Spacebar keycap, Keycap set, resin keycap, anime keycap, Pokemon keycaps, pokemon custom, artisan keycap, keycap cat', '<p>Kirby artisan keycap: A new way to cuteness</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With the previous 2 versions of<strong> Kirby artisan keycap</strong>, surely you are not too surprised with the cuteness of Kirby in the new release of  Kirby keycap </p>\r\n\r\n<p>With this Kirby artisan keycap, we\'ve doubled the cuteness with a chubby body and pink cheek blushes on the green Planet Popstar.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This Kirby resin keycap  was created with exceptional attention to detail and a striking color scheme. Even more remarkable is that every aspect of these beautifully detailed miniatures is completely crafted by hand.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Besides Kirby artisan keycap. Don’t forget to take a look at our other artisan keycaps today!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Designed and hand-painted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade.</li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'cute-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('koi-artisan-keyboard-knob', 'Koi Artisan Keyboard Knob', 'New Arrival', 44.98, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/MMYEPzot_Koi-artisan-keyboard-knob-8.jpg', 'black keycap, koi spacbar keycap, Ctrl Keycap, keycap for keyboard, keycaps custom, yin yang keycap, anime keycap, keyboard volume knob, keyboard knob rotary, keychron knob, colorful knob, gmmk knob, keyboard knob', '<p><strong>Exquisite Handmade Koi Artisan Keyboard Knob</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Elevate your typing experience with our handmade <strong>Koi Artisan Keyboard Knob</strong>. Each piece is meticulously crafted, ensuring a unique and beautiful addition to your keyboard. The Koi design symbolizes strength and perseverance, adding a touch of elegance to your daily routine.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This resin keyboard knob not only enhances the aesthetic of your keyboard but also provides a tactile delight, making typing more enjoyable. Perfect for enthusiasts who appreciate the blend of art and functionality in their workspace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Discover more exquisite resin keyboard knobs and elevate your typing experience by visiting our <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=keyboard-knobs\">resin keyboard knob category</a>. Enhance your setup today with a piece that’s truly one-of-a-kind.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech Specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Profile keycap OEM R1</li>\r\n	<li>Profile row: R1</li>\r\n	<li>Height: ~ 12 mm (0,47 in) </li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it into the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keyboard-knobs', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('lucario-pokemon-keycap', 'Lucario Pokemon Keycap', 'New Arrival', 29.5, 42.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/6FtV8mTX_Lucario-pokemon-keycap-8-e1705075974347.jpg', 'Lucario keycap, Lucario, keycap, keycaps, pokemon keycap, pokemon, boyfriend gift', '<p>This Pokemon artisans keycap was created by a Vietnamese resin artist - Inspired by the famous cartoon Pokemon - Lucario Pokemon Keycap.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It took at least 7 days to complete this piece, they were painted in watercolor layer by layer. The resin is then poured into thin layers and allowed to dry completely and continues with a new layer of paint. The Pokemon gradually appear and look like a 3d cube. Epoxy resins will keep them forever so you can see the Pokemon artisans every day right in your home or office.<br>\r\nThe attention to detail, different types of materials, obvious time and effort spent make a one of a kind, tranquil piece of art. Makes a great, unique gift and a beautiful decor piece.<br>\r\nWorks used to decorate your keyboard, office desk make you feel more comfortable and relaxed.<br>\r\nResin has been stabilized but may discolor if placed in direct sunlight / UV light for extended period of time. Best to keep away from direct UV sources and extreme temperatures. Do not clean this artwork with chemicals! Keep dry and away from extreme temperatures.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want any custom Pokemon artisans keycaps, please send me a message, we can make it for you.</p>', 'keycaps', 'pokemon-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('luffy-one-piece-epoxy-lamp', 'Luffy One Piece Epoxy Lamp', 'Best Product', 59, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/Tf0JpKbK_Luffy-one-piece-epoxy-lamp-10.jpg', 'desk lamp, kids night light, moon night light, bedroom decor, custom night light, cute night light, one piece, anime light night, luffy, one piece lamp, Luffy lamp, one piece fan, anime', '<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sail into the night with Captain Luffy!</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade with high-quality epoxy resin</li>\r\n	<li>Vibrant 3D image of Luffy, the iconic Straw Hat pirate</li>\r\n	<li>Available in 3 sizes to fit any space</li>\r\n	<li>Soft, warm LED light creates a cozy ambiance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Illuminate your space with the adventurous spirit of Monkey D. Luffy, the determined protagonist of the beloved manga series One Piece. This handcrafted epoxy lamp is a work of art that captures Luffy\'s infectious energy and will transport you right into the heart of the One Piece world. Whether you\'re a diehard fan or simply love unique home decor, this Luffy lamp is a must-have that will bring joy and wonder to any room.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Luffy Epoxy Lamp is perfect for anime lovers, desk spaces, bedrooms, or anywhere you want to add a touch of playful, whimsical style. Its warm LED light creates a soothing, calming glow, making it ideal for use as a nightlight or accent piece. With 3 size options available, you can find the perfect fit to complement your space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 2.4\"x3.5\"x2.4\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 2.8\"x4.7\"x2.8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt;</p>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('luffy-one-piece-keycap', 'Luffy One Piece Keycap', 'Best Product', 29.5, 39.9, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/t4izBM4M_luffy-keycap-1-1.jpg-1.jpg', 'One Piece Keycap, Luffy Hat Keycap, Luffy One Piece, Keycap One piece, Keycap Anime, One Piece Hat Keycap, Mechanical Keyboard, Luffy Gear 5, anime keycap set, Wanted Luffy Keycap, artisan keycap set, Christmas Gift', '<p>Open the treasure to see Luffy One Piece keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among Heroverse\'s anime keycaps, Monkey D. Luffy is a special character that is loved by many many anime fans.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Luffy One Piece keycap</strong> is the leader of the Straw Hat Pirates and also the strongest member. Following him is following his journey to be the pirate king, a being believed to have the most freedom in the world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For an energetic and passionate character like Straw Hat Luffy, we want to depict his power and will strength by using red color for the background inside the Luffy One Piece artisan keycap.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The miniature Luffy One Piece resin keycap is molded meticulously so that each distinctive feature of this character is showcased perfectly. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>An opened red coat showing off a muscular body. A yellow straw hat on black shaggy hair. A big smile that won’t be blown away easily on the brightest face. Your favorite character is closer to you than ever.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don’t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n	<li>We can make the keycaps in your chosen colors so please inform us.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('lugia-pokemon-keycap', 'Lugia Pokemon Keycap', 'New Arrival', 29.5, 42.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/2ydzhYPr_lugia-pokemon-keycap-e1657599283969.jpg', 'Lugia, pokemon keycap, Lugia keycap, keycap, keycaps, pokemon', '<p>Level up your Pokémon collection with Lugia Pokemon Artisan Keycap.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The tiny Lugia Pokemon is cast in resin detailedly with 3 - 5 layers of paint color. The result is a Lugia that looks so lively and you can feel its unique power. Altogether, it creates a more diverse and interactive effect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the generation that remote working becomes common, time spending at home increases. Having a unique, inspired piece added to your keyboard will help you be more relax and comfortable in computer working.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>The process of making an artisan keycap is complicated, but we enjoy it….</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We always produce the keycap characters by casting them through shaped molds. We do not have them easily printed in 3D and just like that, the keycap details come straight out of a machine. Everything is done by the hands of our artisans, preparing the molds, pouring resin, and coloring the details.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ultimately, this painting step is hands down one of the hardest things we faced during the production of Heroverse. Pokemon molds in the collection are very small, so it’s very challenging to paint the Pokemon and keep them spirited as much as possible. We had to apply 3 - 5 layers of paint for each keycap so the colors can have a certain thickness and be clearer to our eyes.<br>\r\nWe hope you can wait patiently to receive our keycaps!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Made from durable resin hand-painted in eye-popping colors by our artisans, each little toad is painted by hand to ensure it lives up to our high standards. This will obviously add some more inspiration to your work corner and keep you more creative to do what you love and love what you do.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We’re open to any request you want on your personalized Pokemon keycap. Feel free to contact us.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Material: Resin<br>\r\n- Profile: 1U<br>\r\n- Compatible with Cherry MX switches<br>\r\n- Designed and hand-painted by Heroverse</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handling time: about 4 - 6 weeks</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shipping time:<br>\r\nEstimated shipping date: 3 weeks from the shipping date</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Notes:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- This product is handmade, every keycap that you receive will a little bit different such as the texture, the color...<br>\r\n- For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it into the water. Wet tissue is acceptable<br>\r\n- Refunds/Returns Policy: We do not accept returns or exchanges unless the item you purchased is defective by the production process.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handmade in Vietnam</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ready to ship worldwide</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kindly provide your phone number to make sure we can deliver to you on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you and happy shopping!</p>', 'keycaps', 'pokemon-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('manta-rays-and-diver-night-lights', 'Manta Rays And Diver Night Lights', 'Best Product', 55.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/kVzj7Abu_manta-ray-night-light-4.jpg.jpg', 'epoxy resin wood, blue ocean lamp, christmas gift, personalized gift, handmade gift, couples gift, Lamp scuba diver, Mermaid Coral lamp, custom epoxy lamp, table night light, mermaid gift lamp, home decor resin, art deco diorama', '<p>Manta rays and diver scenery captured by geometric epoxy lamp</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The light enters from the bottom of the captivating resin wood lamp, which lights the manta ray and the cave divers. Turn on the lights at night, and the room will be bathed in this enigmatic hue. The lighting is controlled by buttons and uses monochromatic LEDs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our artisans chose a light blue hue for the transparent part to give you a true ocean sense while decorating your office or home. The images are likely to have some tone fluctuation since this product is made-to-order and completely handmade. However, you can rest assured that the final product we delivered will excel in all aspects from character designs to how they interact with the landscape surrounding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Manta Rays and Diver Night Light</strong> is hand molded and polished to create a smooth, high-gloss finish.It can be displayed in your living room, bedroom, or even your child\'s room. Subsequently, it emits a wonderful soft light that does not disturb sleep at night. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This <strong>resin wood lamp</strong> could be a thoughtful Christmas gift or a kind birthday present for your loved ones. It is a one-of-a-kind piece of art that will transport you to nature, to the depths of the ocean in the midst of the hectic city life, while also stimulating your creativity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 9cmx 14cm (3.5\"x5.5\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 15cmx 24cm (5.9\"x9.5\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('mermaid-and-diver-night-lights', 'Mermaid And Diver Night Lights', 'Flash Deal', 59.99, 109.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/y0v4cx2L_night-light-2-1-e1690633463508.jpg', 'Epoxy lamp, epoxy resin lamp, epoxy resin art, mushroom lamp, lava lamp, resin lamp, custom night light, baby night light, kids night light, girlfriend gift, officiant gift, mermaid lamp, resin wood lamp', '<p>Mermaid and Diver Night Lights: A sound of bewitching charm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Under the golden moonlight reflecting on the sea surface, a voice resounded with the sound of the waves was so soothing to the ears.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ignore the rumor of the mermaid\'s deadly hypnotic voice, but really relax and let go of the whole body with the dim blue light of <strong>Mermaid and Diver Night Lights!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are thousands of stories about mermaids - a creature that everyone thinks does not exist. But in fact, that mermaid with this captivating voice always exists in everyone\'s mind and in the Mermaid and Diver epoxy lamp that comes from Heroverse.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It will never be a bad thing to lie under the soft light of our Mermaid and Diver resin lamp and fall asleep. It will be extremely quality sleep.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Do you want to enjoy other ocean sounds through the lights from Heroverse? Our <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamps</a> bring you closer to the sound of the sea!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Led: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 4.7x5.9 inches</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 6.7x8.6 inches</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 8.2x10.3 inches</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand (USB plug with on and off button)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('mermaid-in-coral-reef-night-light', 'Mermaid In Coral Reef Night Light', 'New Arrival', 89.99, 131.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/waQfbrfk_Manta-ray-and-jellyfish-night-light-6-1.jpg', 'Epoxy lamp, epoxy resin lamp, epoxy resin art, mushroom lamp, lava lamp, resin lamp, custom night light, baby night light, kids night light, girlfriend gift, officiant gift, mermaid lamp, resin wood lamp', '<p><strong>Mermaid in Coral Reef Night Light – Let the Sea Lull You to Sleep!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This enchanting lamp captures the essence of the sea with a magical mermaid scene and ocean design! This piece brings a glow and beauty to your space. The art creates a soothing and beautiful view, with all the shades of blue and the touch of yellow.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each piece is made with the finest quality. As a designer it is our goal to bring you the best handmade art with long-lasting and perfect resin and the best wood to support!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Take a deep dive and get ready to swim, as our colors can give you that feeling with our LED remote control. Set the mood however you would love.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Give the gift of the sea and let your friends dive in. Come and explore our <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamp</a> selection and find something you love!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Led: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 4.7\"x5.9\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 6.7\" x8.6\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 8\"x10\"</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand (USB plug with on and off buttons)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('milotic-pokemon-keycap', 'Milotic Pokemon Keycap', 'Flash Deal', 29.5, 42.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/9j6lShkk_Milotic-pokemon-keycap-4-e1706330899496.jpg', 'Mechanical Keyboard, Artisan Keycap, Custom Keycaps, pokemon keycap, sa profile keycap, pokemon spacebar, Mimikyu Pokemon, Pikachu Charizard, Mewtwo Bulbasaur, Psyduck keycap, fan pokemon keycap, switch keycap, Milotic Pokemon', '<p>The most beautiful of all Pokémon - Milotic keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Milotic has provided inspiration to many artists. It has even been referred to as the most beautiful Pokémon of all. Milotic is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits. It\'s said that a glimpse of a Milotic and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you\'re feeling.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Milotic live at the bottom of large lakes. When this Pokémon\'s body glows a vivid pink, it releases a pulsing wave of energy that brings soothing calm to troubled hearts. nIt has the power to becalm such emotions as anger and hostility to quell bitter feuding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Can take our eyes off this stunning, elegant Milotic inside a keycap. Milotic will stay on your keyboard as charming as it is in Pokémon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Material: Resin<br>\r\n- Size: 1U<br>\r\n- Compatible with Cherry MX switches<br>\r\n- Designed and hand-painted by Heroverse</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handling time: about 2 - 3 weeks</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shipping time:<br>\r\nEstimated shipping date: 3 weeks from the shipping date</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Notes:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- This product is handmade, every keycap that you receive will a little bit different such as the texture, the color...<br>\r\n- For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it into the water. Wet tissue is acceptable<br>\r\n- Refunds/Returns Policy: We do not accept returns or exchanges unless the item you purchased is defective by the production process.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handmade in Vietnam</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ready to ship worldwide</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you and happy shopping!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>', 'keycaps', 'pokemon-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('ms-06-zaku-ii-night-light', 'Ms-06 Zaku Ii Night Light', 'Best Product', 59, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/crzcR3Cn_MS-06-zaku-II-night-light-5.jpg', 'gamer gifts, resin night light, gift for him, room decor, gifts for husband, girl boss, gundam diorama, gundam art, gundam resin, resin lamp, night light kids, boys night light, wall light', '<p><strong>MS-06 Zaku II Night Light: A Miniature World Captured in Resin</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This lamp presents a miniature diorama of a Zaku II. It is navigating through an alien landscape. The swirling resin creates a sense of movement and depth. The details are both captivating and nostalgic. It is a perfect piece of art.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A solid wood base brings a natural feel. The clear, high-quality resin protects the meticulous details inside. This design ensures the details stay vivid for years. It highlights the beauty of the design.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The built-in LED lights offer a customizable glow. Use the remote to change the colors. Watch as the light enhances every contour of the diorama. It will change the mood of your room.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It’s a soothing night light and a captivating desk piece. This would be a wonderful treat for you or a loved one. Check our other epoxy lamps to see other <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?subcategory=anime-lamps&amp;subcategory_id=42\">anime worlds</a> that are waiting to be discovered.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M 2.4\"x3.5\"x2.4\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 2.8\"x4.7\"x2.8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('mudkip-pokemon-keycap-ver-2', 'Mudkip Pokemon Keycap Ver 2', 'New Arrival', 29.5, 36.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/n9uVPplN_Mubkip-pokemon-keycap-ver-2-2-e1704291149740.jpg', 'Pokemon keycap, pokemon custom, pokemon gifts, pokemon aholic, pokemon collecter, keycap artisan, dykeycap, esc keycap, custom resin keycap, gift for friends, Mudkip Pokemon, Mudkip keycap, gift for boyfriend', '<p><strong>MUDKIP Pokemon Keycap – Transform a Charm for Your Keyboard!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Pokémon MUDKIP Keycap is a beautifully crafted miniature that captures the spirit of the iconic Pokémon. The keycap’s colors, dominated by Mudkip’s signature water-blue, are meticulously painted, making every small detail stand out with sharp precision. It’s a tiny masterpiece that brings Mudkip to life right on your keyboard!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This artisan keycap isn’t just visually stunning, it’s also made from high-quality resin that resists yellowing over time. Its durable design ensures it will maintain its vibrant look for years to come, while the precise fit guarantees easy installation and perfect compatibility with your keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The MUDKIP keycap adds a unique, playful touch to your keyboard, turning it into a standout accessory for your desk or workspace. It\'s a must-have for Pokémon fans and makes an exceptional gift. Visit our website to explore more stunning Pokemon keycaps and artisan creations!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech Specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u, 6.25u</li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support (Weak)</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade.</li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'pokemon-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('my-neighbor-totoro-night-light', 'My Neighbor Totoro Night Light', 'Undefine Product', 56, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/3lw2pJry_totoro-lamp-1.png', 'Resin lamp, totoro lamp, anime lamp, chibi totoro, desk lamp, halloween Gift, gift for kids, My Neighbor Totoro, Ghibli figures, epoxy resin lamp, Christmas gifts, anime stickers, Black Friday', '<p><strong>My Neighbor Totoro Night Light - Where Friendship Blossomed</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our My Neighbor Totoro Night Light draws a heartwarming scene just like a masterpiece in life. That\'s all thanks to our durable resin adorned with the skilled strokes of artisans.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All make an inspirational story: Totoro and a delightful little friend live in a peaceful part of the forest, where moonbeams play hide-and-seek with leaves. Their relationship flourished within the branches of an ancient tree and created a heaven of joy and magic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every artisan at Heroverse has worked hard to bring Totoro and the tiny one to life to make this lamp become something special more than simply an ornament but a tale ready to be told. Our excellent craftsmanship ensures that every nuance of My Neighbor Totoro Night Light is beautifully preserved. We turn it into a captivating display in the heart of your space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Totoro Night Light will be a perfect gift for kids, Totoro fans, or just anyone who cherishes friendship in life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let’s discover other stories at Heroverse through magical <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamps</a>!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 4.7x5.9 inches (0.5 inch error)</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 6.7x8.6 inches (0.5inch error)</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 8.2x10.3inches (0.5inch error)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('naruto-artisan-keycap', 'Naruto Artisan Keycap', 'Best Product', 29.5, 39, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/aYx8yeWe_Naruto-artisan-keycap-7-e1705115759962.jpg', 'esc keycap, artisan keycap, Snorlax keycap, anime keycap, spacebar keycap, resin keycap, valorant keycap, gundam keycap, cute keycap, Stitch keycap, Resin, Cherry, naruto keycap', '<p>Naruto keycap: The everlasting determination</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Even though the story ended years ago, Naruto has remained one of the world\'s most well-known anime and manga series.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Naruto stands for Light and all of its properties, including warmth, kindness, emotion, openness to experience, and so on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>From these spiritual meanings, our <strong>Naruto keycap</strong> has been created.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Naruto resin keycap features a depiction of Naruto with extremes of fire and water.  At the start of the series, Naruto is a lot of fun and frequently plays practical jokes on his fellow villagers. Over time, many people began to respect and even admire Naruto for what he did to save the village—and even the whole world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyone can have a sad past, heroes or villains alike. Naruto artisan keycap shows a heartbreaking past, but also tells us that everything ends with happiness and respect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One keycap, one story. Let us tell you more stories with our artisan keycaps!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don’t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n	<li>We can make the keycaps in your chosen colors so please inform us.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('ocellaris-clownfish-keyboard-knob', 'Ocellaris Clownfish Keyboard Knob', 'Best Product', 34.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/q9k4eP8U_ocellaris-clownfish-keyboard-knob-3.jpg', 'custom keycap, keyboard keycaps, gaming keyboard, keyboard knob, keyboard volume knob, gift for boyfriend, keycaps cute, keycaps resin, keycap set, cute keycaps, knob for keyboard, keycap artisan, keycaps anime', '<p>Ocellaris Clownfish Keyboard Knob – Dive into the Vibrant World of Finding Nemo!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Ocellaris Clownfish Keyboard Knob brings a tiny piece of the ocean to your keyboard, capturing the vibrant beauty of the sea. Inside the clear, round keycap, layers of colors blend together like a rainbow. The sandy base of white and tan tones sets the stage for the swirling shades of blue, yellow, orange, and red, creating a dynamic and colorful ocean scene.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At the heart of this aquatic wonder, a small orange and white clownfish swims gracefully above the vibrant waves. The colors are vivid, and every detail, from the fish to the swirling water, is clear and beautifully crafted. This keycap is like a miniature aquarium, with the clownfish stealing the show in a perfect nod to Finding Nemo.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Ocellaris clownfish keyboard knob\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hirosarts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/ocellaris-clownfish-keyboard-knob-2.jpg?resize=500%2C500&amp;ssl=1\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ocellaris clownfish keyboard knob</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you\'re a fan of the ocean, Finding Nemo, or just love unique and vibrant designs, this keycap is a delightful addition to your keyboard. It adds a fun and lively touch to your setup, making your keyboard feel like a little slice of the sea. Explore our website for more <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=keyboard-knobs\">ocean-inspired keycaps</a> to complete your keyboard’s underwater adventure!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Profile keycap: SA</li>\r\n	<li>Height: 16 mm</li>\r\n	<li>Designed and hand-painted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it into the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keyboard-knobs', NULL, '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
