product was 100% handmade.</li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('orca-killer-whale-epoxy-lamp', 'Orca Killer Whale Epoxy Lamp', 'Flash Deal', 56.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/CAxULYIm_orca-killer-whale-epoxy-lamp-2.jpg', 'wood lamp, Unique gift for him, lamps vintage, diorama, scuba diving gift, summer jewelry, Custom Night Light, Resin Lamp, epoxy resin lamp, standing lamp, jellyfish lamp, small lamp, cool lamp', '<p><strong>Orca Killer Whale Epoxy lamp: The Fantasy Seabed</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let’s dive into one specific kind of whale through our <strong>Orca Killer Whale Epoxy lamp.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It’s not strange when saying humans are often curious about what they don’t know and the ocean is one good example.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our <strong>Orca Killer Whale Epoxy Night</strong> <strong>lamp </strong>features a tiny human who is absolutely into her journey of exploring the fantasy of the seabed. Hoping for a close relationship between humans and the deep ocean.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Despite the huge size of the Orca Killer Whales as they are among the largest ones worldwide, a small girl was supposed to have no fear, demonstrating human’s bravery to discover new aspects of life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The blue dim light also strengthens the harmony between human and sea creatures, giving users an impressive and satisfied experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Still interested in the ocean world? Let’s dive into our <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">Epoxy night lamps</a> collection!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specs</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin and Wood</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb</li>\r\n	<li>Size M (4.7\"x5.9\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size L (6.7\"x8.6\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL (8.2\"x10.3\")</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>LED: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Side note</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every product 