('panda-keycap-ver-2', 'Panda Keycap Ver 2', 'New Arrival', 29.5, 36.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/uh53HvyA_panda-keycaps-1-1.jpg-1.jpg', 'esc keycap, artisan keycap, Keycap Backlit, spacebar keycap, anime keycap, panda keycap, custom keycap, cat keycap, cute keycap, scape keycap, keycap set, gaming keyboard, gaming keycap', '<p>Complete your dream as a panda caregiver with Panda keycap ver 2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have given up your dream to be a panda caretaker because you cannot move to live in China, how about adopting a <strong>Panda resin keycap ver 2</strong>? You will have a joyful Panda keycap on your keyboard to bring you an overdose of cuteness every day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The baby panda inside the Panda artisan keycap ver 2 is a healthy and inquisitive child. He loves to explore the bamboo forest so you should make sure he does not wander too far.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After his playful trip, let\'s bring him to the pure blue stream so he can regain his body water. A way to keep him always healthy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Your everyday typing will not be the same anymore with the newly adopted baby. Let the Panda keycap ver 2 teach you what it is to be a panda mother or panda father.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>See more cute keycaps here so you can have a mini zoo on your keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and wat