('red-katana-resin-wrist-rest', 'Red Katana Resin Wrist Rest', 'Flash Deal', 99, 180, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/NGIRt5Qe_katana-wrist-rest-8-e1690632786274.jpg', 'keyboard wrist rest, computer device, handmade wrist rest, computer accessories, keyboard cushion, raised hands rest, wrist rest keycap, Wrist Rest Pad, handmade palm rest, 18th birthday gift, resin wrist rest, Wood wrist rest, White Wrist Rest', '<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Red katana resin wrist rest</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hand-painted and expertly finished, Red Katana Resin Wrist Rest is a must-have item for any Japanese culture lovers. To tweak the variety you like, go ahead and reach us and we\'re happy to help. This <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=wrist-rests\">artisan wrist rest</a> is also available in an array of sizes compatible with layouts ranging from full-size and tenkeyless, which is sure to fit any keyboard. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size 60%: 30 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size 65%: 32 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size TKL: 36 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Full size: 44 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>And we can make any custom size if you want.</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Wood and resin</li>\r\n	<li>Smooth, solvent-resistant polish for surface protection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 wrist rest by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>Easy-clean surface (simply use a damp cloth to wipe)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt;</p>', 'wrist-rests', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('red-river-resin-wood-ashtray', 'Red River Resin Wood Ashtray', 'Top Product', 75, 97.5, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/ZOHtfWV9_red-river-resin-wood-ashtray-2.jpg', 'Ashtray Resin Epoxy,Ashtray epoxy,cigar case wood,vintage decor home,groomsman cigar gift,housewarming gift,birthday gift wood,anniversary gift,gifts for men,vintage ashtray,rolling tray,ashtray resin,coasters handmade', '<p>Elevate your smoking experience with this exquisite handmade cigar ashtray. Crafted from premium wood and infused with vibrant epoxy resin, this unique piece offers both style and functionality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is a natural product. Just as in nature, every tree is different and every slab is different. There are many variations of walnut, wood grain and coloring will be different on each and every ashtray.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size S: 28x14.5x2.4cm</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 19x14.5x2.4cm</li>\r\n	<li>0.5 inches in error</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-trays', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('sailor-moon-night-light', 'Sailor Moon Night Light', 'Flash Deal', 59, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/4A5ApMdH_Sailor-moon-night-light-4.jpg', 'Resin Lamp, Anime Decor, Gift, Night Light, Anime Lamp, Gift For Him, Anime Gift, Resin Night Light, Birthday Gift, gift for kid, Sailor Moon, Neo Queen Serenity', '<ul>\r\n	<li>Size L: 2.8\"x4.7\"x2.8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt;</p>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('scuba-diving-night-light', 'Scuba Diving Night Light', 'Best Product', 49.05, 109.05, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/HIB7m6mc_SCUBA-DIVING-night-light-2.jpg', 'resin lamp, scuba diver gifts, unique gift for him, resin night light, diver night light, birthday gifts, anniversary gifts, gifts for boyfriend, gifts for her, epoxy resin light, scuba diver, freestyle diver, night light lamp', '<p><strong>SCUBA DIVING Night Light – Plunge into Underwater Serenity!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This incredible lamp captures the art of the journey, a dive into the deep ocean for new adventures! Also, the coral reef in the beautiful scenery offers an authentic atmosphere. The scene is illuminated by the glowing and calm colors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bringing the ocean with a design to last, with the finest materials. Each part is hand-crafted to be as authentic as possible. The smooth and lasting wood and resin creates a safe place for the ocean to live!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Control your surroundings by using the LED lights with the remote. Also set the vibe and the emotions. Set that mood you dream of.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Set your mind at peace and enter this lamp world with your friends! Come and explore our <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamp</a> selection and find something you love!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 5.3\".3.5\"x1.4\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 6.7\"x4.3\"x1.4\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 8.3\"x5.3\"x1.4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('sea-turtle-diver-night-light-ver-1', 'Sea Turtle Diver Night Light Ver 1', 'Top Product', 99.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/1WgUsNhG_IMG_0712.jpg.jpg', 'scuba diver lamp, ocean night light, turtle diver light, freediver night lamp, diver resin lamp, turtle resin lamp, diver turtle lamp, epoxy resin lamp, ocean night lamp, diver night light, turtle night light, birthday handmade, handmade night light', '<p>Sea Turtle Diver Night Light Ver 1: A magnificent ocean-theme resin lamp to find peace of mind</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>“</em><em>The human world, it\'s a mess</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Life under the sea</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Is better than anything they got up there”</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some of the greatest lines from the wise crap Sebastian but we doubt even he can’t picture this landscape captured by our <strong>Sea Turtle Diver Lamp Ver 1</strong>. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Heroverse’s artisans craft a peaceful picture of humans and creatures to disrupt the dark and cold associated with the deep sea. A diver joyfully follows the turtle as it guides him through the cave toward the colorful moonlight which is freely customizable with a simple click.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can switch up the led bulb colors up to <strong>10 renditions</strong> with the remote control to align your mood and to illuminate both diver and turtle with a new light. The wooden frame with rough edges adds to the texture of the cave and gives the <strong>Sea Turtle Diver Night Light Ver 1</strong> an elevated look. We choose resin as the main ingredient for the fill since it excels in being timeless, versatile, and just simply gorgeous. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our artisans ensure the balance of the active and inactive parts of the lamp by making the turtle and diver as lively as possible. Hence, we spend countless hours and efforts to render every little detail perfectly vibrant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The lovely <strong>Sea Turtle Diver Night Light Ver 1</strong> is more of a piece of art that gives mood lighting and acts as a functional piece of decor that would look fantastic anywhere in your house or place of work. It can also be used as a nightlight in a child\'s room. After all, this design for a r<a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">esin wood lamp</a> has a calming effect on all demographics.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Led: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 9cmx 12cm (3.5\"x4.7\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 15cmx 22cm (5.9\"x9\")</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 20cmx28cm (8\"x11\")</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand (USB plug with on and off button)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16');
INSERT INTO `products` (`IdProduct`, `NameProduct`, `TypeProduct`, `NewPrice`, `OldPrice`, `StatusProduct`, `ImageURL`, `Tag`, `Description`, `Category`, `SubCategory`, `updated_at`, `created_at`) VALUES
('shenron-dragon-ball-keyboard-knob', 'Shenron Dragon Ball Keyboard Knob', 'Flash Deal', 34.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/8ZSE1Et5_Shenron-dragon-ball-keyboard-knob-1.jpg', 'artisan keycap, shenron dragon ball, dragonball keycap, songoku keycap, keycap resin, keycaps anime, keycaps set, dragon ball keycap, artisan keycap cute, artisan keycap resin, gohan keycap, gotenks keycap', '<p>Elevate Your Keyboard with the Shenlong Dragon Ball Knob</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Add a touch of magic to your workspace with our Shenlong Dragon Ball Keyboard Knob. Handcrafted with precision, this unique accessory brings the legendary dragon Shenlong from Dragon Ball right to your fingertips. Each Shenlong Dragon Ball Keyboard Knob is carefully made, ensuring a one-of-a-kind design that stands out on any keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy the benefits of a personalized keyboard experience. The Shenlong Dragon Ball Knob for Keyboard not only enhances the aesthetics of your setup but also provides a satisfying tactile feel. Perfect for Dragon Ball fans and anyone who appreciates high-quality, handmade craftsmanship.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Shenron dragon ball keyboard knob\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hirosarts.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Shenron-dragon-ball-keyboard-knob-4.jpg?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shenron dragon ball keyboard knob</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ready to upgrade your keyboard? Explore our full range of resin keyboard knobs and find your perfect match <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=keyboard-knobs\">here</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support (Weak)</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 thank you card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade.</li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keyboard-knobs', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('shiny-umbreon-pokemon-keyboard-knob', 'Shiny Umbreon Pokémon Keyboard Knob', 'New Arrival', 34.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/tnJMgSJR_Shiny-umbreon-pokemon-keyboard-knob-6.jpg', 'Pokemon Keycap, Custom Anime Keycap, Custom Pokemon Cap, Spacebar Pokemon, ESC Pokemon, Poke keycap, Christmas Gift', '<p>Transform Your Keyboard with the Shiny Umbreon Pokémon Knob</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Discover the perfect blend of craftsmanship and fandom with our<strong> Shiny Umbreon Pokémon Resin Knob</strong>. This handcrafted piece is designed for Pokémon enthusiasts who seek to personalize their mechanical keyboards with a touch of unique artistry. Each <strong>Shiny Umbreon Pokémon Artisan Knob</strong> is meticulously crafted, ensuring a high-quality and durable finish that stands out on any keyboard.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Shiny Umbreon Pokémon Mechanical Keyboard Knob</strong> not only enhances the aesthetic of your setup but also provides a comfortable and satisfying typing experience. Its ergonomic design and smooth resin surface make it a pleasure to use, whether you\'re gaming, working, or simply browsing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Add a unique touch to your keyboard with the Shiny Umbreon Pokémon Resin Keyboard Knob and explore more options in our resin keyboard knob collection. Visit our <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=keyboard-knobs\">category page</a> to find your perfect match.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech Specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support (Weak)</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 thank you card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade.</li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keyboard-knobs', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('sleeping-snorlax-pokemon-keycap', 'Sleeping Snorlax Pokemon Keycap', 'New Arrival', 29.5, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/3JFbRz8T_IMG_7504-1.jpg.jpg', 'Mechanical Keycap, Star Wars character, custom keycaps, pokemon anime, pokemon art, pokemon keycaps, anime keycaps, artisan keycap, pokemon spacebar, spacebar custom, esc keycap, sa profile keycaps, Christmas Gift', '<p>Embark on a nostalgic journey into the world of Pokémon with the Sleeping Snorlax Pokémon Keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, the Sleeping Snorlax Pokémon Keycap captures the essence of Snorlax in its most endearing form. This beloved character is depicted in a peaceful slumber, capturing the hearts of Pokémon fans young and old.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every element of this keycap, from Snorlax\'s round belly to its tranquil expression, is expertly crafted to bring out the character\'s charm. It\'s not just a keycap; it\'s a tiny work of art that will make your keyboard stand out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rediscover the joy of Pokémon with this charming keycap, and let Snorlax remind you of the adventures and dreams that began with a Game Boy. Make your keyboard a portal to the Pokémon world and infuse your daily tasks with a touch of nostalgia.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Want to capture the magic of Pokémon keycaps and make them a part of your keyboard? Visit us here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Profile: SA profile</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>Please keep this product from heat and water for a long time. Don\'t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'cute-keycaps', '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('spider-man-resin-wrist-rest', 'Spider-Man Resin Wrist Rest', 'Flash Deal', 99, 120, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/c5g6bjBI_spider-man-wrist-rest-3.jpg.jpg', 'keyboard wrist rest, computer device, handmade wrist rest, computer accessories, keyboard cushion, raised hands rest, wrist rest keycap, Wrist Rest Pad, handmade palm rest, 18th birthday gift, resin wrist rest, Wood wrist rest, White Wrist Rest', '<p>Spider-man wrist rest: Give your spirit a great power </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Inspired by the iconic character in the Marvel cinematic world - Spider-man, passionate artisans at Heroverse put their hearts and souls into making the Spider-man resin wrist rest, which features images of the power of defending justice and the innocent from crimes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Spider-man resin wrist rest\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hirosarts.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/spider-man-wrist-rest-5.jpg.jpg?resize=644%2C430&amp;ssl=1\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Spider-man wrist rest</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Spider-man resin wrist rest has a pleasing design and helps you to glide across the smooth surface with ease when typing. The resin and wood wrist rest also comes with a polishing cloth and four rubber bump-ons to prevent it from sliding about on your desk.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hence, this handmade resin and wood wrist rest not only helps you type comfortably all day by relieving wrist stress and strain but also adds a superhero-themed feel to your workspace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Spider-man resin wrist rest\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/hirosarts.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/spider-man-wrist-rest-9.jpg.jpg?resize=644%2C430&amp;ssl=1\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Spider-man wrist rest</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This flawless handcrafted Marvel resin wrist rest creates a cool work of art that will instantly grab your heart. It is also a great gift for your Marvel-lover buddies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Don’t hesitate to grab one now! Please let us know which Marvel superhero you\'d like, and we\'ll make you a custom <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=wrist-rests\">wrist rest</a>. Go check them out on Heroverse!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size 60%: 30 x 1.5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size 65%: 32 x 1.5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size TKL: 36 x 1.5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Full size: 44 x 1.5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)</li>\r\n	<li>We can also create any custom size you want</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin epoxy</li>\r\n	<li>Smooth, solvent-resistant polish for surface protection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 Spider-man wrist rest by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every item was 100% handmade by Heroverse artists.  The finished product may differ somewhat from the original images. We hope you understand any reasonable differences</li>\r\n	<li>Easy-clean surface (simply use a damp cloth to wipe)</li>\r\n	<li>Custom orders are welcome. Please share your design with us so that we can customize it for you.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'wrist-rests', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('stitch-artisan-keycap', 'Stitch Artisan Keycap', 'New Arrival', 24.99, 39, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/vnvc8RCs_Stitch-artisan-keycap-2.jpg', 'artisan keycap, resin keycap, stitch keycaps, keycap artisan, artisan keycap anime, artisan keycaps, keycaps artisan, stitch resin, pbt keycap set, artisan esc keycaps, PapazKeycap, Papaz', '<p>Say ‘Aloha!” to the adorable Stitch artisan keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the Heroverse laboratory, we carefully researched and experimented to come up with an ultimate creation. It had to be the most powerful and evilest creature of all anime keycaps.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However, the <strong>Stitch artisan keycap</strong> was born with a too cute appearance, which was a letdown. The artisans, ahem, scientists named him 626 to remind us of how many failed experiments have been.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But, we could never expect that the <strong>Stitch resin keycap</strong> turned out to be the worst nightmare. Never let his blueish, childish, cutie-ish face take you off guard!!!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Well, the thing is, one day, the <strong>Stitch keycap </strong>began to act like a lovely puppy of a family. So, we sent many scientists to observe the phenomenon, and can you guess the answer?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That is Aloha. A spirit of family. With a lot of love and caring, he is no longer a destroyer but a caring family member to anyone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aloha! Let the spirit invite you to visit our keycap family at this link.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade.</li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('surfing-pikachu-pokemon-epoxy-lamp', 'Surfing Pikachu Pokemon Epoxy Lamp', 'Flash Deal', 59, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/JLMkOFm4_Surfing-pikachu-pokemon-lamp-5.jpg', 'Resin lamp, pokemon birthday, epoxy resin lamp, 3d printed lamp, epoxy lamp, epoxy night light, custom resin lamp, decor lamp, pikachu, pokemon starter, pokemon gift, night lamp, pokemon epoxy lamp', '<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Catch the Wave of Fun with the Surfing Pikachu Pokémon Epoxy Lamp</strong></p>\r\n\r\n	<p>Ride the waves with the Surfing Pikachu Pokémon Epoxy Lamp! This lively design showcases Pikachu’s playful spirit as it surfs on a brilliant, wave-inspired base. The cheerful glow it emits brings a sense of excitement and joy, making it the perfect addition to any Pokémon fan\'s collection.</p>\r\n\r\n	<p>Crafted from durable, eco-friendly epoxy resin and set on a sturdy wooden base, this lamp is built to last. With vibrant LED lighting and a remote control, you can adjust the lamp’s color to match your mood, whether you prefer a calming blue or a fiery orange glow, this lamp adapts to your style.</p>\r\n\r\n	<p>This lamp is not only a fantastic nightlight but also a fun and playful decoration for your desk or living room. Perfect for gifting or personal use, and don’t forget to check out our other <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">Pokemon-themed lamps</a> for even more collectible designs!</p>\r\n\r\n	<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>Size M: 2.4\"x3.5\"x2.4\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 2.8\"x4.7\"x2.8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handmade Night Light USB cable for the light stand</p>', 'resin-lamps', 'pokemon-lamps', '2025-05-15', '2025-05-15'),
('surfing-pikachu-pokemon-keycap', 'Surfing Pikachu Pokemon Keycap', 'Flash Deal', 29.5, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/ahVYtANL_pikachu-keycap-5.jpg.jpg', 'pokemon keycap, custom pokemon gift, artisan keycaps, custom gift, birthday gift, mechanical keyboard, gift for her, gift for him, keycap custom, resin keycap, cute keycap, pikachu keycap, gaming keycap', '<p>This resin keycap was created by a Vietnamese resin artist - Inspired by the famous cartoon Pokemon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Little does everybody know, we always produce the keycap characters by casting them through shaped moulds. We do not have them easily printed in 3D and just like that, the keycap details come straight out of a machine. Everything is done by the hands of our artisans, preparing the moulds, pouring resin, and colouring the details.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ultimately, this painting step is hands down one of the hardest things we faced during the production of Heroverse. Pokemon moulds in the collection are very small, so it’s very challenging to paint the pokemon and keep them spirited as much as possible. We had to apply 3 - 5 layers of paint for each keycap so the colours can have a certain thickness and be clearer to our eyes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We hope you can wait patiently to receive our keycaps!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech Specs</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Profile: SA profile</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>Please keep this product from heat and water for a long time. Don\'t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'pokemon-keycaps', '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('the-knight-hollow-knight-resin-lamp', 'The Knight Hollow Knight Resin Lamp', 'Flash Deal', 68.5, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/n2o77uFl_The-Knight-Hollow-Knight-Resin-Lamp-3-1.jpg', 'kids night light, custom night light, gaming decor, hollow knight pin, hollow knight figure, hornet hollow knight, video game poster, hollow knight, lightning mcqueen, marble hornets, green hornet pole, asian hornet vial, anime lamp', '<p>Enchant Your Space with the The Knight Hollow Knight Resin Lamp</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enhance your living space with the handmade <strong>The Knight Hollow Knight Resin Lamp</strong>. This unique piece, carefully crafted by Heroverse, combines artistry and functionality to create a captivating light source. <strong>The Knight Hollow Knight Resin Lamp</strong> is perfect for fans of the game, adding a touch of magic and ambiance to any room.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The handmade nature of the <strong>The Knight Hollow Knight Epoxy Lamp</strong> ensures that each piece is unique, offering a personal touch that mass-produced items simply can\'t match. The lamp provides a soothing light, making it ideal for relaxing evenings, reading, or simply enjoying its beauty.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Don\'t miss out on this exquisite piece. Discover more epoxy lamps in our collection by visiting the <a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamp category</a> on our website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 5.5x2.8x2.8\" (14X7.1x7.1cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 6.3x3.5x3.5\" (16x8.9x8.9cm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'halloween-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('togepi-pokemon-keycap', 'Togepi Pokemon Keycap', 'New Arrival', 29.5, 42.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/AOVIVGyy_1u-keycap-11-e1657612729955.jpg', 'pokemon keycap, custom pokemon gift, artisan keycaps, resin keycaps, custom gift, birthday gift, mechanical keyboard, gift for her, gift for him, keycap custom, resin keycap, cute keycap, Togepi keycap', '<p>Little does everybody know, we always produce the keycap characters by casting them through shaped molds. We do not have them easily printed in 3D and just like that, the keycap details come straight out of a machine. Everything is done by the hands of our artisans, preparing the molds, pouring resin, and coloring the details.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ultimately, this painting step is hands down one of the hardest things we faced during the production of Heroverse. Pokemon molds in the collection are very small, so it’s very challenging to paint the pokemon keycap and keep them spirited as much as possible. We had to apply 3 - 5 layers of paint for each keycap so the colors can have a certain thickness and be clearer to our eyes.<br>\r\nWe hope you can wait patiently to receive our Pokemon keycap!</p>', 'keycaps', 'pokemon-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('tony-tony-chopper-keycap', 'Tony Tony Chopper Keycap', 'New Arrival', 24.99, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/IxhshTQI_chopper-one-piece-keycap-11.jpg', 'One Piece Keycap, zoro key cap, Mechanical Keycap, Artisan Keycap, keycap One piece, Luffy OP Keycap, Artisan Onepiece, custom keycap, esc keycap, Chopper Keycap, Christmas Gift', '<p>Cotton candy lover - Tony Tony Chopper resin keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tony Tony Chopper artisan keycap</strong> is a doctor reindeer that loves cotton candy. As a sixth member of the Straw Hat Pirate crew, you should not look down on this guy just because he looks small and cute.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Okay! Who am I kidding? <strong>Tony Tony Chopper SA Profile keycap </strong>is an adorable innocent and shy kid. He is not made for fighting. Anyway, he is a doctor so his mission is to keep people’s health in check.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But, when his friend is in need, <strong>Tony Tony Chopper resin keycap</strong> knows it’s time to gather courage and fight for his crew just like anyone else. Our doctor reindeer is a real true friend, so having <strong>Tony Tony Chopper keycap</strong> around will definitely bring a smile to everyone. A big smile.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You know what <strong>Tony Tony Chopper artisan keycap</strong> loves right? Give him a lot of cotton candy so he can live up to his cotton candy lover nickname.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you love anime like us, take a look at the Heroverse anime keycap collection and you may see your favorite franchise there.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Materials: resin</li>\r\n	<li>Profile: SA profile</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('toothless-artisan-keycap-v2', 'Toothless Artisan Keycap V2', 'Flash Deal', 16.99, 46, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/dxgtNehq_toothless-keycap-2.jpg.jpg', 'clear keycaps, matching keycaps, space keycaps, custom keycaps, resin keycaps, keyboard display, kawaii keyboard, gaming keyboard, koi keycaps, keyboard keys, toothless heart, dsa keycap, toothless keycap', '<p>How to train the Toothless artisan keycap V2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mr. Hiccup Horrendous Haddock III\'s Night Fury is here to be your nightmare, or maybe not?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Well, with that kind of cuteness, he can only be a good dream anyway. So, are you ready to tame your first <strong>Toothless resin keycap V2</strong>? He will be the best friend that carries you and your typing experience flying through the vast sky.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you wonder that training Mr. Night Fury might be too difficult, don’t worry and just look at the cutie-friendly smile of the <strong>Toothless artisan keycap V2</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Heroverse artisans try to show off the skill a little bit with this <strong>Toothless dragon keycap</strong>. We had come up with many methods to recreate the dragon scales as well as other minor details before deciding on the best ones.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Finally, we can present you with a <strong>Black Toothless keycap</strong> and a <strong>White Toothless figurine</strong> that is not only adorable but also of decent quality. Moreover, the finest resin will allow your journey with Toothless to be time-withstanding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, why don’t you take a shot and tame your very first dragon? A new journey is promised for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And, Mr. Night Fury keycap here is our second version. We have already tamed him before and let us tell you a secret, that guy, Toothless resin keycap V1, is genuinely popular. Besides the <strong>Toothless resin figurines</strong>, Heroverse has more keycap buddies that will probably enchant you. Let’s visit them and have fun greetings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Materials: resin</li>\r\n	<li>Profile:</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u</li>\r\n	<li>Color: Black and White</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'cute-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('torii-gate-artisan-keycap', 'Torii Gate Artisan Keycap', 'Best Product', 22.99, 34.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/ZU3Ifs4s_Torii-Gate-artisan-keycap-2-e1657600462512.jpg', 'custom keycaps, artisan keycap, resin keycap, ESC keycap, japanese keycaps, cute keycaps, anime keycaps, mechanical keycaps, landscape keycap, torii keycap, mechanical keyboard, resin keycaps, torii gate keycap', '<p>Immerse yourself in Japanese culture with Torii gate artisan keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our <strong>Torii gate artisan keycap</strong> was inspired by the traditional Japanese gate - Torii. In Japanese culture, the Torii gate is considered the symbolic gate to the spiritual world and is associated with the legend of the sun goddess Amaterasu Omikami. Legend has it that after the intense conflicts with her brother, the storm god Susanowo due to this man’s sabotage of the habitat and killing a maidservant in a drunken state, Amaterasu hit the roof and hid in the mountains. The Amanoiwato cave made the whole world fall into darkness. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>After making great attempts, her family succeeded in bringing her out of the cave. The gods placed the roosters on the top of the mistletoe, and when they crowded, Amaterasu heard the chaos outside, so she popped his face out of the cave, allowing sunlight to return to the world. That mistletoe is the origin of the Torii gate in Japanese Shinto.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This gate still stands firmly without being buried in the ground. Due to the fact that it is built on the sea, this Torii gate is hidden in the seawater according to the flow of the ebb tide creating one of the most breath-taking and famous scenes in Japan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The existence of the bright red Torii gate is the most vivid proof of the important role Shinto plays in Japanese culture. For Japanese people, all things are gods, and they all contain a soul with all kinds of emotions. That\'s the reason for their gratitude and respect towards nature, peace, and simplicity of which the Torii gates are the greatest emblems.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now the home of some of the most beautiful legends is encased in a gorgeous resin artisan keycaps, where you can immerse yourself in Japanese culture. So don’t miss out on our<strong> Torii gate artisan keycap</strong>!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin epoxy</li>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Profile keycap: SA</li>\r\n	<li>Profile row: ESC</li>\r\n	<li>Height: ~ 16 mm </li>\r\n	<li>Backlit &amp; UV light support (Weak)</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it into the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'cute-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('uchiha-itachi-keycap', 'Uchiha Itachi Keycap', 'Flash Deal', 29.5, 39.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/Zc3htIti_itachi-keycap-4.jpg', 'anime merch, anime, itachi uchiha, uchiha, naruto, akatsuki, sharingan, hidden leaf, big brother', '<p>Step into the world of Naruto with our Uchiha Itachi keycap</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Itachi Uchiha is a fan-favorite character known for his incredible strength, intelligence, and unwavering loyalty.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He sacrificed his own reputation and wellbeing to protect his village from the Uchiha clan\'s rebellion, and he ultimately gave his life to protect his younger brother and the greater good.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Uchiha Itachi keycap is a fitting tribute to this iconic character, showcasing his powerful presence and unwavering dedication to his clan and village. With its stunning design and durable construction, this keycap is a must-have accessory for any Naruto fan looking to pay homage to this legendary figure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech Specs</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Switch type: Compatible with Cherry MX switches &amp; clones</li>\r\n	<li>Materials: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Profile: SA profile</li>\r\n	<li>Design and Handcrafted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Sidenote</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Don\'t soak it in the water. Wet tissue is acceptable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('vaporeon-epoxy-lamp', 'Vaporeon Epoxy Lamp', 'Undefine Product', 69.9, 0, 'Publish', 'https://breakwoodart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/2WlC6e4a_362_1800x1800.jpg', 'Resin lamp,pokemon birthday,epoxy resin lamp,3d printed lamp,epoxy lamp,resin night light,epoxy night light,custom resin lamp,eevee,eevee evolution,flareon,vaporeon,pokemon gift', '<p>Size:<br>\r\nLarge lamp: ~3.6\" (9 cm) * ~3.6\" (9 cm) * 6.2 (16 cm)<br>\r\nMedium lamp: ~3\" (7.5 cm) * ~3\" (7.5 cm) * 4.9 (12 cm)<br>\r\nSmall lamp: ~2.4\" (9 cm) * ~2.4\" (6 cm) * 3.6 (9 cm)<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis resin lamp, resin night light is made from wood and resin. This product is handmade, every lamp that you receive will a little bit different such as the the position of the poke.mon, the color, ... We promise to do my best to ensure product quality. Thank you for your understanding and we are more than happy to support you!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesigned, assembled and ships from our shop in Hanoi, Vietnam.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPackage includes:<br>\r\n- Resin lamp<br>\r\n- USB wooden magnetic light stand<br>\r\n- USB cable for the light stand<br>\r\n- Remote (without batteries)<br>\r\n- Led: 10 colors, 5W<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSHIPPING &amp; RETURN<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAll of our items are made to order and the production times (the time it takes us to make the item) can be found on each product page. A majority of our items are made within 7-15 business days, but double check the product page for accurate and up to date production times.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe do our best to ensure that each item is high-quality and a product that we can stand behind, but we understand that sometimes it doesn\'t work out. If your product arrives defective, we sent you the wrong item - no problem! Let us know within 30 days of the delivery date and we will gladly provide a full store credit or refund.</p>', 'resin-lamps', 'anime-lamps', '2026-01-05', '2026-01-05'),
('walnut-epoxy-resin-live-edge-cheese-tray', 'Walnut Epoxy Resin Live Edge Cheese Tray', 'Flash Deal', 67, 0, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/rNGcie5S_walnut-epoxy-resin-live-edge-cheese-tray-11.jpg', 'serving tray, cutting board, housewarming gift, kitchenware, epoxy resin tray, 3th Anniversary gift, wedding hangers, wedding presets, wedding decoration, wedding portrait, wood tray, decorative tray, Gift for wife', '<p>Combined with wood and resin epoxy, which have completed their service to humanity and nature, the value they deserve and turn them into the most special item of your living space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of a kind beautiful live edge black walnut and epoxy river charcuterie serving board with metal handles. This unique board can also serve as an ottoman tray.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is a natural product. Just as in nature, every tree is different and every slab is different. There are many variations of walnut, wood grain and coloring will be different on each and every board.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Size M: 9\"x17\"x0.7\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size L: 11\"x22\"x0.7\"</li>\r\n	<li>Size XL: 13\'\'x28\'\'x0.7\'\'</li>\r\n	<li>0.5 inches in error</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-trays', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20'),
('whale-shark-and-couple-diver-night-lights', 'Whale Shark And Couple Diver Night Lights', 'Undefine Product', 49.99, 99.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/9aq4K43j_Whale-shark-and-couple-diver-night-lights-6.jpg', 'Night light scuba, shark lamp resin, epoxy resin lamp, Blue ocean lamp, lamp epoxy resin, custom resin lamp, Personalized gift, Art deco lamp, Handmade gift, Baby gift, Artisan Resin art, anniversary gift, birthday gift', '<p><strong>Whale Shark and couple Diver Night Lights: Where humans and natural creatures can coexist peacefully</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let go of all the tension of today and immerse yourself in the dreamy night with <strong>Whale Shark and couple Diver Night Lights</strong>!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Artists at Heroverse have combined resin and wood to depict scenes wherein a couple and whale sharks first encounter when both are enthralled by sea divers\' exploration of the underwater world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>More than a light lamp, this Whale Shark and Scuba Diving Couple Night Lights will be the true work of art in your room.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What could be better to level up your private space with this Whale Shark and Scuba Diving Couple Resin lamp. It not only makes a nice décor, but also makes all the sadness, loneliness, and stress go. The only thing you need to do is simply turn on the light.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wanna explore other corners of the underwater world? Then, look no further than our<a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\"> </a><a href=\"https://heroverseart.com/catalog?category=epoxy-lamps\">epoxy lamp</a>! </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tech specs:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Led: 10 colors, 5W</li>\r\n	<li>SizeM: 4.3x4.7\" (11x12cm)<br>\r\n	Size L: 5.5x6.3\" (14x16cm)<br>\r\n	Size XL: 6.7x7.5\" (17x19cm)</li>\r\n	<li>Color-Changing Light Bulb</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand (USB plug with on and off button)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inside the package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Handmade Night Light</li>\r\n	<li>USB cable for the light stand</li>\r\n	<li>Remote Control (No battery)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'resin-lamps', 'ocean-lamps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('winnie-the-pooh-artisan-keycap', 'Winnie The Pooh Artisan Keycap', 'Flash Deal', 29.5, 42.99, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/zbJzocO0_winnie-the-pooh-keycap-6-e1658140974449.jpg', 'resin keycap, keycaps cherry mx, keycaps artisan, keycaps set backlit, custom escape keycap, the bear, artisan keycap, esc keycap, enter keycap, keycap artisan, cute keycap, gift for son, cute bear', '<p><strong>Immerse ourselves in childhood memories with Winnie the Pooh Artisan Keycap</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It has been nearly a century since author A. A. Milne first published the Pooh stories in 1926. Until now, the story of cute Pooh still remains in our hearts. Winnie the Pooh and his Hundred Acre Woods pals will always be among our favorite characters. They\'re cute and cuddly, friendly, and occasionally a little too curious. But there\'s nothing wrong with being intrigued by our  <strong>Winnie the Pooh Artisan Keycap</strong>!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It brought our Heroverse team a lot of childhood feelings when creating this Cute Resin Winnie the Pooh Artisan Keycap. All the details were sophisticatedly crafted, which requires extraordinary artisanship skills to simulate the jungle scenery like in our memory.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To increase its lifelike and authentic features, we concentrate more on painting to create a lighting effect that resembles the real Hundred Acre Wood. Look at this artisan keycap and you can fully image yourself in Pooh’s adventures, from becoming a rain cloud, dealing with enraged honey bees, to meandering through the Hundred Acre Wood.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tech Specs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Material: Resin</li>\r\n	<li>Height: 16mm</li>\r\n	<li>Profile row: SA R1</li>\r\n	<li>Size: 1u (ESC)</li>\r\n	<li>Designed and hand-painted by Heroverse</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Inside the package:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1 Winnie the Pooh Artisan Keycap by Heroverse</li>\r\n	<li>1 card</li>\r\n	<li>2 rubber finger gloves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sidenote:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every product was 100% handmade. </li>\r\n	<li>The final product may vary slightly from the original photos. We would love to ask you to tolerate any reasonable differences.</li>\r\n	<li>For a long time use, please keep this product away from heat and water. Simply use a damped tissue to clean the surface.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'keycaps', 'anime-keycaps', '2025-12-16', '2025-12-16'),
('yin-yang-resin-and-wood-wrist-rest', 'Yin Yang Resin And Wood Wrist Rest', 'Undefine Product', 59, 138.32, 'Publish', 'https://heroverseart.sgp1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/images/JfKFp3fO_black-white-wrist-rest-e1657601962803.jpg', 'wrist rest keycap, Wrist Rest Pad, handmade palm rest, resin wrist rest, Wood wrist rest, Brown wrist rest, custom wrist rest, pc masterrace, Yin Yang Wrist rest, Black wrist rest, Heroverse wrist rest, wrist rest resin, Gaming wrist rest', '<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The wrist rest is visually aesthetic and allows you to glide effortlessly across the smooth surface while typing. The resin and wood wrist rest includes a polishing cloth and four rubber bump-on to keep it from sliding on your desktop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have 4 size:<br>\r\nSize 60% : 30 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)<br>\r\nSize 65% : 32 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)<br>\r\nSize TKL : 36 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)<br>\r\nSize Full size : 44 x 1,5 x 2 (the thinnest place is 1.5 cm)<br>\r\nAnd we can make any custom size if you want.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The thickness of the wrist rests we have carefully researched to suit all types of mechanical keyboards and avoid warping when used for a long time and with different weather.<br>\r\nMaterial: Wood and resin<br>\r\nSmooth, solvent-resistant polish for surface protection<br>\r\nEasy-clean surface (simply use a damp cloth to wipe)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kindly share with us your design, we can customize that for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Handmade in Vietnam</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ready to ship worldwide</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kindly provide your phone number to make sure we can deliver to you on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you and happy shopping!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\"&gt; </p>', 'wrist-rests', NULL, '2025-05-20', '2025-05-20');
